{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0114pasv8sQNhssmne3xf4qS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"复现 CIVO collapse 的多 seed 验证。008d 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8)。 Registry 已完成: 009e (s1) + 009b (s2)。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 131.08,\n7\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 4.12,\n8\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_step\": 55000,\n9\t      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n10\t      \"seed1_collapse_type\": \"classic_CIVO_value_driven\",\n11\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 267.93,\n12\t      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 2.05,\n13\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_step\": 25000,\n14\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n15\t      \"seed2_self_correction\": true,\n16\t      \"seed2_nve_final\": 0.38,\n17\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"2/2\",\n18\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2\",\n19\t      \"independent_collapse_rate\": \"1/2 (008d s0 与 009e s1 共享 seed=1, 视为同一观测)\"\n20\t    },\n21\t    \"tables\": [\n22\t      {\n23\t        \"name\": \"Table: Walker 008d Cross-Seed Comparison\",\n24\t        \"columns\": [\n25\t          \"Seed\",\n26\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n27\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n28\t          \"NVE_peak_step\",\n29\t          \"Collapse?\",\n30\t          \"Pattern\"\n31\t        ],\n32\t        \"rows\": [\n33\t          [\n34\t            \"s0 (008d)\",\n35\t            \"82.75\",\n36\t            \"4.12\",\n37\t            \"55K\",\n38\t            \"Yes\",\n39\t            \"Value-driven, entropy ↓\"\n40\t          ],\n41\t          [\n42\t            \"s1 (009e)\",\n43\t            \"131.08\",\n44\t            \"4.12\",\n45\t            \"55K\",\n46\t            \"Yes\",\n47\t            \"Same seed as s0, deterministic replication\"\n48\t          ],\n49\t          [\n50\t            \"s2 (009b)\",\n51\t            \"267.93\",\n52\t            \"2.05\",\n53\t            \"25K\",\n54\t            \"No\",\n55\t            \"Transient NVE → self-correction\"\n56\t          ]\n57\t        ]\n58\t      }\n59\t    ],\n60\t    \"figures\": [],\n61\t    \"analysis\": \"C2 核心证据：trained dt_emb 可靠触发 NVE>1.5× (2/2 independent seeds)。 Collapse 是 stochastic (1/2)，但 diagnostic marker 是 deterministic。 Best 档审稿人接受这一区分，不要求 deterministic collapse。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 2/2 trained dt_emb seeds 均超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 CIVO 诊断标记的 强 supporting evidence。审稿人理解 collapse 是 stochastic 的——关键发现不是 \\\"必然崩溃\\\" 而是 \\\"trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态过估值 (NVE>1.5×)\\\"。 Seed 1 的经典 CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓, NVE 1.78→2.09→4.12 加速) vs Seed 2 的自我修正 (NVE 2.05→1.62→0.38 衰减) 被视为丰富了 CIVO 动态的理解， 而非削弱了 claim。Sustained vs transient NVE>1.5× 的差异性（seed 1 连续3个 checkpoint 维持>1.5× → 不可逆; seed 2 仅一次突破 → 自我修正）与 Henderson et al. 2018 的早期随机性影响结论一致。\\n\"\n62\t  },\n63\t  {\n64\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n65\t    \"description\": \"C2 因果控制的多 seed 验证。008f 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, dt_embed_dim=0, H=8)。 Registry: 009f (s1) killed → 使用替代 seeds (008f_s3, 008f_s4); 009c (s2) done。\\n\",\n66\t    \"results\": {\n67\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 148.34,\n68\t      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 1.26,\n69\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 1.14,\n70\t      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n71\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 363.8,\n72\t      \"seed3_nve_peak\": \"<1.5x\",\n73\t      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n74\t      \"seed4_eval_105K\": 306.5,\n75\t      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 1.41,\n76\t      \"seed4_nve_105K\": 0.58,\n77\t      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n78\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n79\t      \"reward_MAE_baseline_ratio\": \"~75x\"\n80\t    },\n81\t    \"tables\": [\n82\t      {\n83\t        \"name\": \"Table: 008f Causal Control Cross-Seed\",\n84\t        \"columns\": [\n85\t          \"Seed\",\n86\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n87\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n88\t          \"NVE@105K\",\n89\t          \"CIVO?\"\n90\t        ],\n91\t        \"rows\": [\n92\t          [\n93\t            \"s0 (008f)\",\n94\t            \"503\",\n95\t            \"1.02\",\n96\t            \"0.30\",\n97\t            \"No\"\n98\t          ],\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"s2 (009c)\",\n101\t            \"148.34\",\n102\t            \"1.26\",\n103\t            \"1.14\",\n104\t            \"No\"\n105\t          ],\n106\t          [\n107\t            \"s3\",\n108\t            \"363.8\",\n109\t            \"<1.5\",\n110\t            \"—\",\n111\t            \"No\"\n112\t          ],\n113\t          [\n114\t            \"s4\",\n115\t            \"306.5\",\n116\t            \"1.41\",\n117\t            \"0.58\",\n118\t            \"No\"\n119\t          ]\n120\t        ]\n121\t      }\n122\t    ],\n123\t    \"figures\": [],\n124\t    \"analysis\": \"与 008d 2/2 对比，形成 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的完美二分类。 Best 档审稿人视 008f 为 \\\"definitive causal control\\\"，008f 的低 eval 被理解为 因果控制实验的预期代价。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 0/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 dt_embedding 因果控制的决定性证据。 与 008d 的 2/2 形成 5/5 完美分离（trained 2/2 exceed, untrained 0/3 never exceed）。 审稿人注意到 009c 的 NVE=1.14@105K 接近但未达 1.5× threshold，且 008f_s4 的 transient NVE=1.41@85K 也在 threshold 以下——threshold 的区分力成立。 008f reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）是已知 trade-off: 去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2。审稿人接受这不削弱因果结论——因果控制实验证明的是 \\\"去掉 X → 无崩溃\\\"，不需要 reward 预测同样好。R8 被 preempt。\\n\"\n125\t  },\n126\t  {\n127\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n128\t    \"description\": \"C3 value growth suppression 多 seed 验证。008a 配置 (dt=2, subsample OFF, trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 data, H=15)。Registry 已完成: 008a_unexposed_s1, s2。\\n\",\n129\t    \"results\": {\n130\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 630.91,\n131\t      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.43,\n132\t      \"seed1_civo_alert\": 0,\n133\t      \"seed1_delta_ve\": -0.0028,\n134\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 899.4,\n135\t      \"seed2_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.333,\n136\t      \"seed2_civo_alert\": 0,\n137\t      \"seed2_delta_ve\": -0.003,\n138\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/2\",\n139\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 765.2,\n140\t      \"cross_seed_eval_range\": \"631-899\",\n141\t      \"vs_baseline_mean\": \"83.5%\"\n142\t    },\n143\t    \"tables\": [\n144\t      {\n145\t        \"name\": \"Table: 008a Unexposed Cross-Seed\",\n146\t        \"columns\": [\n147\t          \"Seed\",\n148\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n149\t          \"VE ratio@105K\",\n150\t          \"NVE@105K\",\n151\t          \"Pattern\"\n152\t        ],\n153\t        \"rows\": [\n154\t          [\n155\t            \"s0 (008a)\",\n156\t            \"777.66\",\n157\t            \"0.386\",\n158\t            \"0.59\",\n159\t            \"Zigzag recovery, 2 V-cycles\"\n160\t          ],\n161\t          [\n162\t            \"s1\",\n163\t            \"630.91\",\n164\t            \"0.43\",\n165\t            \"~0.65\",\n166\t            \"Rising trend\"\n167\t          ],\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"s2\",\n170\t            \"899.4\",\n171\t            \"0.333\",\n172\t            \"~0.51\",\n173\t            \"Strong convergence, near-baseline\"\n174\t          ]\n175\t        ]\n176\t      }\n177\t    ],\n178\t    \"figures\": [],\n179\t    \"analysis\": \"C3 核心证据加强。3 seeds 一致展现 value suppression (NVE 0.51-0.65x)。 高 seed variance (631-899) 被理解为 dt>1 数据缺失导致的学习不稳定， 而非方法论缺陷。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, unexposed dt_emb（trained 但训练数据中无 dt>1 transition）的两个新 seed 均展现 value suppression + 无 CIVO。Seed 2 特别强 (899.4 = 98% baseline)。 Cross-seed 均值 765 (83.5% baseline) 显著优于 008f (均值 ~330, 36% baseline)。 审稿人将此解读为: 真正有害的不是 dt_embedding 本身的存在，而是当 training data 中含有 dt>1 transitions 时 dt_embedding 学到 dt-specific representations。 这强化了 C2 的机制性解释（RSSM fidelity gap + learned conditioning amplification）， 而非简单的 \\\"有 dt_emb = 坏\\\"。\\n\"\n180\t  },\n181\t  {\n182\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\",\n183\t    \"description\": \"C6 dt=1 imagination 效果验证。008e_v3 配置 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imagination, subsample ON, H=15)。Registry 已完成: s1 (success), s2 (collapsed non-CIVO)。\\n\",\n184\t    \"results\": {\n185\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 869.88,\n186\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.8,\n187\t      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.527,\n188\t      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n189\t      \"seed1_gate_dt_1_frac\": 1.0,\n190\t      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 136.96,\n191\t      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 3.78,\n192\t      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 3.78,\n193\t      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n194\t      \"seed2_collapse_onset\": \"95K\",\n195\t      \"seed2_actor_entropy_trend\": \"rising (-5.21@85K → -3.83@105K)\",\n196\t      \"seed2_gate_dt_1_frac\": 1.0,\n197\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2\",\n198\t      \"collapse_mechanism_difference\": \"seed2 = eval-driven (Pathway B), not value-driven (Pathway A)\"\n199\t    },\n200\t    \"tables\": [\n201\t      {\n202\t        \"name\": \"Table: Pathway A vs Pathway B Collapse Dynamics\",\n203\t        \"columns\": [\n204\t          \"Feature\",\n205\t          \"008d s0 (Pathway A)\",\n206\t          \"008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B)\"\n207\t        ],\n208\t        \"rows\": [\n209\t          [\n210\t            \"Value change\",\n211\t            \"Explosive (60→138, +130%@55K)\",\n212\t            \"Moderate (339→384→340, +13%→-12%)\"\n213\t          ],\n214\t          [\n215\t            \"Eval change\",\n216\t            \"Post-value (146→83, -43%)\",\n217\t            \"Leads (715→452→137, -81%)\"\n218\t          ],\n219\t          [\n220\t            \"NVE driver\",\n221\t            \"Value numerator (value explosion)\",\n222\t            \"Eval denominator (eval crash)\"\n223\t          ],\n224\t          [\n225\t            \"Actor entropy\",\n226\t            \"↓ (-3.47→-4.88, policy locks)\",\n227\t            \"↑ (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizes)\"\n228\t          ],\n229\t          [\n230\t            \"Mechanism\",\n231\t            \"Critic overestimate → actor exploit\",\n232\t            \"Eval crash → value lag\"\n233\t          ]\n234\t        ]\n235\t      }\n236\t    ],\n237\t    \"figures\": [],\n238\t    \"analysis\": \"C6 从 \\\"practical mitigation\\\" 降级为 \\\"mechanistic insight: trained dt_emb 创建 多条脆弱通道\\\"。Best 档审稿人视此为 honest reporting + deeper understanding， 而非 weakness。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 被透明报告并获审稿人认可。dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同： - 008d s0 (Pathway A): value 爆炸 → actor exploit → eval 下跌，entropy ↓ - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B): eval 先跌 → NVE 被动升高，entropy ↑ (策略变随机) 审稿人接受 \\\"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways\\\" 这一更深层洞察。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。这实际上丰富了论文贡献——CIVO 不是唯一的脆弱通道。\\n\"\n239\t  },\n240\t  {\n241\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\",\n242\t    \"description\": \"诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否为 CIVO 必要条件。dt_embedding 保持随机初始化但 freeze (requires_grad=False)。Registry 已完成: exp_015b。\\n\",\n243\t    \"results\": {\n244\t      \"eval_105K\": 204.2,\n245\t      \"nve_85K\": 0.467,\n246\t      \"nve_95K\": 0.394,\n247\t      \"nve_105K\": 0.42,\n248\t      \"collapse\": false,\n249\t      \"actor_loss_105K\": 0.000179,\n250\t      \"actor_entropy_105K\": -4.855,\n251\t      \"value_mean_105K\": 56.212,\n252\t      \"gate_dt_mean\": 2.0,\n253\t      \"collapse_mechanism\": \"gradient_starvation_from_frozen_dt_emb\"\n254\t    },\n255\t    \"tables\": [\n256\t      {\n257\t        \"name\": \"Table: dt_emb 2×2 Ablation Matrix\",\n258\t        \"columns\": [\n259\t          \"Config\",\n260\t          \"dt_emb state\",\n261\t          \"Exposed to dt>1?\",\n262\t          \"CIVO?\",\n263\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n264\t          \"NVE range\"\n265\t        ],\n266\t        \"rows\": [\n267\t          [\n268\t            \"008d\",\n269\t            \"Trained\",\n270\t            \"Yes (subsample ON)\",\n271\t            \"Yes (2/2)\",\n272\t            \"82-131\",\n273\t            \"1.71-4.12\"\n274\t          ],\n275\t          [\n276\t            \"008a\",\n277\t            \"Trained\",\n278\t            \"No (subsample OFF)\",\n279\t            \"No (0/3)\",\n280\t            \"631-899\",\n281\t            \"0.51-0.65\"\n282\t          ],\n283\t          [\n284\t            \"008f\",\n285\t            \"Removed (dim=0)\",\n286\t            \"Yes\",\n287\t            \"No (0/4)\",\n288\t            \"148-503\",\n289\t            \"0.30-1.41\"\n290\t          ],\n291\t          [\n292\t            \"015b\",\n293\t            \"Frozen (random init)\",\n294\t            \"Yes\",\n295\t            \"No (0/1)\",\n296\t            \"204\",\n297\t            \"0.39-0.47\"\n298\t          ]\n299\t        ]\n300\t      }\n301\t    ],\n302\t    \"figures\": [],\n303\t    \"analysis\": \"闭合因果推理: dt_emb training + exposure to dt>1 data 两个条件同时满足时才触发 CIVO。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, frozen dt_emb 不崩溃但性能很差 (204 = 22% baseline)。NVE 全程 0.39-0.47 (远低于 1.0×, critic 严重低估)，actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）。这确认了 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——没有训练的 dt_embedding 只是噪声输入， 不会创建 RSSM 对精确 dt 信号的 co-adaptation。但 frozen embedding 引入了 新问题（梯度饥饿），证明这不是一个可行的 mitigation 方向。 审稿人将此视为 2×2 消融矩阵 (008a/008d/008f/015b) 的完成： - 008d (trained + subsample ON): CIVO ✓ - 008a (trained + subsample OFF): No CIVO ✓ (unexposed) - 008f (removed, subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (no embedding) - 015b (frozen + subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (frozen) 只有 008d (trained AND exposed to dt>1 data) 产生 CIVO → training 是必要条件。\\n\"\n304\t  },\n305\t  {\n306\t    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\",\n307\t    \"description\": \"缩小 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) 崩溃概率估计区间。Registry 已完成: s3 + s4。\\n\",\n308\t    \"results\": {\n309\t      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 92.7,\n310\t      \"seed3_nve_peak\": 4.02,\n311\t      \"seed3_collapse\": true,\n312\t      \"seed3_collapse_onset\": \"85K-95K\",\n313\t      \"seed3_actor_entropy_final\": -4.892,\n314\t      \"seed4_eval_105K\": 899.3,\n315\t      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 0.99,\n316\t      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n317\t      \"total_008e_v3_collapse_rate\": \"2/4 (50%)\",\n318\t      \"collapse_pathway_breakdown\": \"s2 = Pathway B (eval-driven, entropy ↑); s3 = mixed (entropy remains low)\"\n319\t    },\n320\t    \"tables\": [\n321\t      {\n322\t        \"name\": \"Table: 008e_v3 Cross-Seed Summary (dt=1 imagination)\",\n323\t        \"columns\": [\n324\t          \"Seed\",\n325\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n326\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n327\t          \"Collapse?\",\n328\t          \"Pathway\"\n329\t        ],\n330\t        \"rows\": [\n331\t          [\n332\t            \"s1 (008e_v3)\",\n333\t            \"869.9\",\n334\t            \"0.80\",\n335\t            \"No\",\n336\t            \"Healthy\"\n337\t          ],\n338\t          [\n339\t            \"s2\",\n340\t            \"137.0\",\n341\t            \"3.78\",\n342\t            \"Yes\",\n343\t            \"B (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n344\t          ],\n345\t          [\n346\t            \"s3\",\n347\t            \"92.7\",\n348\t            \"4.02\",\n349\t            \"Yes\",\n350\t            \"Mixed (entropy stays low)\"\n351\t          ],\n352\t          [\n353\t            \"s4\",\n354\t            \"899.3\",\n355\t            \"0.99\",\n356\t            \"No\",\n357\t            \"Healthy\"\n358\t          ]\n359\t        ]\n360\t      }\n361\t    ],\n362\t    \"figures\": [],\n363\t    \"analysis\": \"50% collapse rate 确认 dt=1 imagination 非有效 mitigation。Best 档审稿人 视此为诚实报告 + 对 trained dt_emb 多通道脆弱性的系统性证据。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 2/4 崩溃率 (50%) 与 008d 的 1/2 (50%) 完全一致——dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。这是 C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 的最有力量化证据。 s3 崩溃 (NVE 4.02, entropy stays low at -4.892) 引入了第三种可能的动态模式， 但 best 档审稿人不要求对每个 seed 的机制差异做完整解释——4 seeds 确认 50% 崩溃率已经足够。核心结论: trained dt_embedding 是根本脆弱源，dt=1 imagination 只消除了一条特定通道 (Pathway A) 但不消除全部通道。\\n\"\n364\t  },\n365\t  {\n366\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n367\t    \"description\": \"第二 DMC 环境基准线。Registry 已有 5 seeds (023a/023b/023_s2/s3/s4)。\\n\",\n368\t    \"results\": {\n369\t      \"seed0_eval_final\": 624.7,\n370\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 520.3,\n371\t      \"seed2_eval_final\": 645.4,\n372\t      \"seed3_eval_final\": 642.13,\n373\t      \"seed4_eval_final\": 537.03,\n374\t      \"cross_seed_mean\": 593.9,\n375\t      \"cross_seed_std\": 56.8,\n376\t      \"cross_seed_range\": \"520-645\",\n377\t      \"ve_ratio_converged\": \"0.65-0.70\",\n378\t      \"ve_ratio_stable_from\": \"150K+\"\n379\t    },\n380\t    \"tables\": [\n381\t      {\n382\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Baseline Cross-Seed\",\n383\t        \"columns\": [\n384\t          \"Seed\",\n385\t          \"Eval final\",\n386\t          \"Peak eval\",\n387\t          \"VE ratio converged\"\n388\t        ],\n389\t        \"rows\": [\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"s0\",\n392\t            \"624.7\",\n393\t            \"624.7\",\n394\t            \"~0.67\"\n395\t          ],\n396\t          [\n397\t            \"s1\",\n398\t            \"520.3\",\n399\t            \"572.9\",\n400\t            \"~0.65\"\n401\t          ],\n402\t          [\n403\t            \"s2\",\n404\t            \"645.4\",\n405\t            \"645.4\",\n406\t            \"~0.68\"\n407\t          ],\n408\t          [\n409\t            \"s3\",\n410\t            \"642.1\",\n411\t            \"685.9\",\n412\t            \"~0.69\"\n413\t          ],\n414\t          [\n415\t            \"s4\",\n416\t            \"537.0 (ext→642)\",\n417\t            \"642.3\",\n418\t            \"~0.66\"\n419\t          ]\n420\t        ]\n421\t      }\n422\t    ],\n423\t    \"figures\": [],\n424\t    \"analysis\": \"Robust baseline。Cross-seed IQM ~600，用于所有 Cheetah CIVO 实验的归一化。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah baseline 提供了 NVE 归一化的可靠分母。5 seeds 的一致性 (std=56.8, CV=9.6%) 表明 Cheetah 环境有适度但可接受的 seed variance。 VE ratio 收敛到 0.65-0.70 (类似 Walker 的 0.69-0.72)，支持 NVE 归一化方法 在跨环境的适用性。审稿人接受 5 seeds 足够建立可靠 baseline。 s4 的 194K→204K eval 骤降 (537→302) 被确认为 transient fluctuation (延长到 300K 恢复到 642)，不是 instability。\\n\"\n425\t  },\n426\t  {\n427\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n428\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah 环境 CIVO 复现。Registry: 010b (s1 eval 51.7, NVE 8.27) + 010b_s0 (eval 0.83, NVE 70.64)。需 seed 2 预测。\\n\",\n429\t    \"results\": {\n430\t      \"seed0_eval_final\": 0.83,\n431\t      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 70.64,\n432\t      \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n433\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 51.7,\n434\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 8.27,\n435\t      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n436\t      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 38.5,\n437\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 12.4,\n438\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"55K\",\n439\t      \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n440\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"3/3\",\n441\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"3/3\",\n442\t      \"cheetah_vs_walker_severity\": \"Cheetah NVE peaks 2-9× higher than Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×)\"\n443\t    },\n444\t    \"tables\": [\n445\t      {\n446\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah CIVO Trigger Cross-Seed\",\n447\t        \"columns\": [\n448\t          \"Seed\",\n449\t          \"Eval final\",\n450\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n451\t          \"Collapse?\",\n452\t          \"Baseline%\"\n453\t        ],\n454\t        \"rows\": [\n455\t          [\n456\t            \"s0\",\n457\t            \"0.83\",\n458\t            \"70.64\",\n459\t            \"Yes\",\n460\t            \"0.1%\"\n461\t          ],\n462\t          [\n463\t            \"s1\",\n464\t            \"51.7\",\n465\t            \"8.27\",\n466\t            \"Yes\",\n467\t            \"8.7%\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n471\t            \"38.5\",\n472\t            \"12.4\",\n473\t            \"Yes\",\n474\t            \"6.5%\"\n475\t          ]\n476\t        ]\n477\t      }\n478\t    ],\n479\t    \"figures\": [],\n480\t    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 100% collapse rate 加强了 C1 + C2。与 Walker 的 severity 差异 提供了额外的 mechanistic insight。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah CIVO 比 Walker 更严重但 100% 一致。Cheetah 的 3/3 崩溃率 (vs Walker 的 ~50%) 表明环境复杂度放大了 CIVO——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 RSSM fidelity gap → 更强的 value overestimation feedback loop。 NVE peaks 远高于 Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×) 同样支持这一解读。 审稿人将跨环境 NVE severity 差异视为支持 \\\"CIVO severity scales with RSSM prediction difficulty\\\" 的证据——这不是 noise，而是 signal。 Seed 2 预测基于 s0/s1 的模式: Cheetah 中 CIVO 更可靠 (100% vs Walker 50%)， NVE peak 在 8-70× 范围内。保守预测 12.4× 处于该范围中段。\\n\"\n481\t  },\n482\t  {\n483\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n484\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah 因果控制。Registry: 024b_s0 (eval 96.5, no CIVO), 024b_s1 (eval 77.3). Need seed 2 prediction.\\n\",\n485\t    \"results\": {\n486\t      \"seed0_eval_final\": 96.5,\n487\t      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 0.2,\n488\t      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n489\t      \"seed1_eval_final\": 77.3,\n490\t      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.1,\n491\t      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n492\t      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 88.2,\n493\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.15,\n494\t      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n495\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n496\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 87.3,\n497\t      \"vs_baseline\": \"14.7%\",\n498\t      \"reward_prediction_quality\": \"severely degraded (similar to Walker 008f pattern)\"\n499\t    },\n500\t    \"tables\": [\n501\t      {\n502\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Causal Control (no dt_emb)\",\n503\t        \"columns\": [\n504\t          \"Seed\",\n505\t          \"Eval final\",\n506\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n507\t          \"CIVO?\",\n508\t          \"Baseline%\"\n509\t        ],\n510\t        \"rows\": [\n511\t          [\n512\t            \"s0\",\n513\t            \"96.5\",\n514\t            \"0.2\",\n515\t            \"No\",\n516\t            \"15.4%\"\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"s1\",\n520\t            \"77.3\",\n521\t            \"0.1\",\n522\t            \"No\",\n523\t            \"12.3%\"\n524\t          ],\n525\t          [\n526\t            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n527\t            \"88.2\",\n528\t            \"0.15\",\n529\t            \"No\",\n530\t            \"14.8%\"\n531\t          ]\n532\t        ]\n533\t      }\n534\t    ],\n535\t    \"figures\": [],\n536\t    \"analysis\": \"跨环境因果控制复现。dt_embedding removal 的 5/5 (Walker) + 3/3 (Cheetah) = 8/8 CIVO prevention rate。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah no-dt-emb 完美复现 Walker 008f 的模式: 0/3 CIVO, 但 eval 严重下降 (14.7% baseline)。NVE 全程极低 (<0.2×)，连 baseline 水平的 value 估计都无法达到。这不是好的 mitigation (性能损失太大)，但作为因果控制完美: 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 消失。 Cheetah 的 dt-emb-removal 性能损失 (14.7%) 比 Walker (36%) 更大，这合理—— Cheetah 的更复杂 dynamics 意味着缺失 temporal information 的代价更高。 审稿人接受 008f/024b 是因果控制而非推荐方案。\\n\"\n537\t  },\n538\t  {\n539\t    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n540\t    \"description\": \"Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 验证 (C3)。Registry: 008a_cheetah_s0 (532.35, NVE 0.49), s1 (504.38, NVE 0.478). Need seed 2 prediction.\\n\",\n541\t    \"results\": {\n542\t      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 532.35,\n543\t      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.49,\n544\t      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n545\t      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 504.38,\n546\t      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.478,\n547\t      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n548\t      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 518.6,\n549\t      \"seed2_nve_105K_predicted\": 0.48,\n550\t      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n551\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n552\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 518.4,\n553\t      \"vs_baseline\": \"87.3%\",\n554\t      \"vs_no_dt_emb\": \"5.9x better (518 vs 87)\"\n555\t    },\n556\t    \"tables\": [\n557\t      {\n558\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Unexposed dt_emb (C3 validation)\",\n559\t        \"columns\": [\n560\t          \"Seed\",\n561\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n562\t          \"NVE@105K\",\n563\t          \"CIVO?\",\n564\t          \"Baseline%\"\n565\t        ],\n566\t        \"rows\": [\n567\t          [\n568\t            \"s0\",\n569\t            \"532.4\",\n570\t            \"0.49\",\n571\t            \"No\",\n572\t            \"89.7%\"\n573\t          ],\n574\t          [\n575\t            \"s1\",\n576\t            \"504.4\",\n577\t            \"0.48\",\n578\t            \"No\",\n579\t            \"84.9%\"\n580\t          ],\n581\t          [\n582\t            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n583\t            \"518.6\",\n584\t            \"0.48\",\n585\t            \"No\",\n586\t            \"87.3%\"\n587\t          ]\n588\t        ]\n589\t      }\n590\t    ],\n591\t    \"figures\": [],\n592\t    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨环境验证完成。Unexposed dt_emb 在两环境均提供 >83% baseline 性能和 NVE<0.5×。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 展现出与 Walker 008a 一致的 pattern: 接近 baseline 的性能 (87% vs Walker 83.5%), NVE 全程受抑 (0.48-0.49×), 无 CIVO。这与 no-dt-emb (plan_022, 14.7% baseline) 形成鲜明对比—— 保留 dt_embedding 但不暴露于 dt>1 data 是明显更优的方案。 跨环境一致性极高 (Walker 83.5% vs Cheetah 87.3% of baseline)，审稿人将此 视为 C3 在第二环境的强复现。Seed variance 在 Cheetah 很小 (504-532, 2.7%) vs Walker 的较大 variance (631-899, 17.4%)——可能因为 Cheetah 的 simpler reward structure 导致更一致的学习。\\n\"\n593\t  },\n594\t  {\n595\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n596\t    \"description\": \"非运动型 DMC 环境基准线。DreamerV3 proprioceptive Cartpole Swingup。 全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n597\t    \"results\": {\n598\t      \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 842.3,\n599\t      \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 818.6,\n600\t      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 854.1,\n601\t      \"cross_seed_mean_predicted\": 838.3,\n602\t      \"cross_seed_std_predicted\": 18.0,\n603\t      \"convergence_step_predicted\": \"~80K (faster than Walker ~100K due to simpler dynamics)\",\n604\t      \"ve_ratio_converged_predicted\": \"0.68-0.73\",\n605\t      \"eval_peak_range_predicted\": \"850-870\"\n606\t    },\n607\t    \"tables\": [\n608\t      {\n609\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole Swingup Baseline (predicted)\",\n610\t        \"columns\": [\n611\t          \"Seed\",\n612\t          \"Eval final\",\n613\t          \"VE ratio\",\n614\t          \"Convergence step\"\n615\t        ],\n616\t        \"rows\": [\n617\t          [\n618\t            \"s0\",\n619\t            \"842.3\",\n620\t            \"0.71\",\n621\t            \"~78K\"\n622\t          ],\n623\t          [\n624\t            \"s1\",\n625\t            \"818.6\",\n626\t            \"0.69\",\n627\t            \"~82K\"\n628\t          ],\n629\t          [\n630\t            \"s2\",\n631\t            \"854.1\",\n632\t            \"0.73\",\n633\t            \"~76K\"\n634\t          ]\n635\t        ]\n636\t      }\n637\t    ],\n638\t    \"figures\": [],\n639\t    \"analysis\": \"非运动环境 baseline 确立。对 C1/C2/C3 的跨 task-type 验证至关重要。 但 best 档 narrative 指出 Walker+Cheetah+PickCube 已足够——Cartpole 是 additional strength, not a requirement。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole Swingup baseline 提供非运动环境的参考点。DreamerV3 在 proprioceptive Cartpole 上通常达到 ~830-860 (基于公开 benchmark)。 收敛更快 (~80K vs Walker ~100K) 因为 observation space 更小 (5D vs 24D) 且 dynamics 更简单。VE ratio 收敛到类似 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~0.70 范围， 表明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration 跨环境一致。 低 seed variance (CV ~2.1%) 预期因为 Cartpole 的 simpler dynamics 导致 更一致的学习。审稿人接受这作为第三环境 baseline。\\n\"\n640\t  },\n641\t  {\n642\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n643\t    \"description\": \"非运动环境 CIVO 复现。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n644\t    \"results\": {\n645\t      \"seed0_eval_105K_predicted\": 127.4,\n646\t      \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 3.21,\n647\t      \"seed0_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"55K\",\n648\t      \"seed0_collapse_predicted\": true,\n649\t      \"seed1_eval_105K_predicted\": 612.7,\n650\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 1.83,\n651\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"45K\",\n652\t      \"seed1_collapse_predicted\": false,\n653\t      \"seed1_self_correction_predicted\": true,\n654\t      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 95.6,\n655\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 4.47,\n656\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"65K\",\n657\t      \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n658\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"3/3\",\n659\t      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted\": \"2/3\"\n660\t    },\n661\t    \"tables\": [\n662\t      {\n663\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole CIVO Trigger (predicted)\",\n664\t        \"columns\": [\n665\t          \"Seed\",\n666\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n667\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n668\t          \"Collapse?\",\n669\t          \"Pattern\"\n670\t        ],\n671\t        \"rows\": [\n672\t          [\n673\t            \"s0\",\n674\t            \"127.4\",\n675\t            \"3.21\",\n676\t            \"Yes\",\n677\t            \"Classic CIVO\"\n678\t          ],\n679\t          [\n680\t            \"s1\",\n681\t            \"612.7\",\n682\t            \"1.83\",\n683\t            \"No\",\n684\t            \"Transient → self-correction\"\n685\t          ],\n686\t          [\n687\t            \"s2\",\n688\t            \"95.6\",\n689\t            \"4.47\",\n690\t            \"Yes\",\n691\t            \"Classic CIVO\"\n692\t          ]\n693\t        ]\n694\t      }\n695\t    ],\n696\t    \"figures\": [],\n697\t    \"analysis\": \"非运动环境 CIVO 确认。3/3 NVE>1.5× + 2/3 collapse, 与 locomotion 一致。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole CIVO 表现与 Walker 类似而非 Cheetah。Cartpole 的简单 dynamics 意味着 RSSM fidelity gap 中等 (类似 Walker)，所以 CIVO severity 处于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间。3/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× (诊断标记一致), 2/3 collapse (类似 Walker 50% rate)。 Seed 1 自我修正模式与 009b (Walker) 一致——transient NVE>1.5× 后衰减。 这跨环境复现了 \\\"sustained vs transient NVE\\\" 的 stochastic divergence 模式。 审稿人将此视为 CIVO 机制跨 task type 的强验证——不仅限于 locomotion。 NVE peaks (1.83-4.47) 处于 Walker (2.05-4.12) 类似范围，而非 Cheetah 的 极端范围 (8-70×)，支持 \\\"CIVO severity ~ RSSM difficulty\\\" 假设。\\n\"\n698\t  },\n699\t  {\n700\t    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n701\t    \"description\": \"非运动环境因果控制。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n702\t    \"results\": {\n703\t      \"seed0_eval_105K_predicted\": 312.4,\n704\t      \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.35,\n705\t      \"seed0_civo_predicted\": false,\n706\t      \"seed1_eval_105K_predicted\": 278.9,\n707\t      \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.42,\n708\t      \"seed1_civo_predicted\": false,\n709\t      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 335.1,\n710\t      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.28,\n711\t      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n712\t      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"0/3\",\n713\t      \"cross_seed_eval_mean_predicted\": 308.8,\n714\t      \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"36.8%\"\n715\t    },\n716\t    \"tables\": [\n717\t      {\n718\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole Causal Control (predicted)\",\n719\t        \"columns\": [\n720\t          \"Seed\",\n721\t          \"Eval@105K\",\n722\t          \"NVE_peak\",\n723\t          \"CIVO?\",\n724\t          \"Baseline%\"\n725\t        ],\n726\t        \"rows\": [\n727\t          [\n728\t            \"s0\",\n729\t            \"312.4\",\n730\t            \"0.35\",\n731\t            \"No\",\n732\t            \"37.1%\"\n733\t          ],\n734\t          [\n735\t            \"s1\",\n736\t            \"278.9\",\n737\t            \"0.42\",\n738\t            \"No\",\n739\t            \"33.1%\"\n740\t          ],\n741\t          [\n742\t            \"s2\",\n743\t            \"335.1\",\n744\t            \"0.28\",\n745\t            \"No\",\n746\t            \"39.9%\"\n747\t          ]\n748\t        ]\n749\t      }\n750\t    ],\n751\t    \"figures\": [],\n752\t    \"analysis\": \"第三环境因果控制完成。dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO prevention 跨所有环境。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole no-dt-emb 复现 Walker/Cheetah 的因果控制模式: 0/3 CIVO, eval 显著低于 baseline (36.8%)。 Cartpole 的 eval loss (63.2%) 介于 Walker (64%) 和 Cheetah (85.3%) 之间， 与环境复杂度的排序一致 (Cheetah > Cartpole > Walker in temporal info value)。 但这可能存在混淆 (Cartpole 的 temporal info 可能天然不如 locomotion 重要)， best 档审稿人不深究此点——关键是 CIVO prevention = 100%。 跨三环境汇总: dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO (Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + Cartpole 0/3 + PickCube 0/1)。\\n\"\n753\t  },\n754\t  {\n755\t    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n756\t    \"description\": \"RSSM fidelity gap 量化。Registry 已完成: exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis。\\n\",\n757\t    \"results\": {\n758\t      \"baseline_dt1_obs_MSE\": 13.49,\n759\t      \"baseline_dt2_obs_MSE\": 27.5,\n760\t      \"baseline_obs_gap\": 2.04,\n761\t      \"baseline_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.0102,\n762\t      \"baseline_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.0159,\n763\t      \"baseline_reward_gap\": 1.56,\n764\t      \"008d_dt1_obs_MSE\": 41.31,\n765\t      \"008d_dt2_obs_MSE\": 53.67,\n766\t      \"008d_obs_gap\": 1.3,\n767\t      \"008d_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.0568,\n768\t      \"008d_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.1579,\n769\t      \"008d_reward_gap\": 2.78,\n770\t      \"008f_dt1_obs_MSE\": 8.01,\n771\t      \"008f_dt2_obs_MSE\": 22.04,\n772\t      \"008f_obs_gap\": 2.75,\n773\t      \"008f_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.7469,\n774\t      \"008f_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.7526,\n775\t      \"008f_reward_gap\": 1.01\n776\t    },\n777\t    \"tables\": [\n778\t      {\n779\t        \"name\": \"Table 1 (论文): RSSM Fidelity Analysis\",\n780\t        \"columns\": [\n781\t          \"Model\",\n782\t          \"dt1 obs_MSE\",\n783\t          \"dt2 obs_MSE\",\n784\t          \"obs gap\",\n785\t          \"dt1 rew_MAE\",\n786\t          \"dt2 rew_MAE\",\n787\t          \"rew gap\"\n788\t        ],\n789\t        \"rows\": [\n790\t          [\n791\t            \"Baseline (dt=1)\",\n792\t            \"13.49\",\n793\t            \"27.50\",\n794\t            \"2.04×\",\n795\t            \"0.010\",\n796\t            \"0.016\",\n797\t            \"1.56×\"\n798\t          ],\n799\t          [\n800\t            \"008d (trained dt_emb)\",\n801\t            \"41.31\",\n802\t            \"53.67\",\n803\t            \"1.30×*\",\n804\t            \"0.057\",\n805\t            \"0.158\",\n806\t            \"2.78×\"\n807\t          ],\n808\t          [\n809\t            \"008f (no dt_emb)\",\n810\t            \"8.01\",\n811\t            \"22.04\",\n812\t            \"2.75×\",\n813\t            \"0.747\",\n814\t            \"0.753\",\n815\t            \"1.01×\"\n816\t          ]\n817\t        ]\n818\t      }\n819\t    ],\n820\t    \"figures\": [],\n821\t    \"analysis\": \"Figure 4 / Table 1 核心证据。三模型对比完整揭示 trained dt_emb 如何创建 CIVO 的 forward-pass 基础。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, RSSM fidelity 表是 C2 机制解释的核心定量支撑。关键 insight: (1) 008d obs_gap 仅 1.30× (看似小), 但 dt1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3× → 模型本身已崩塌，低 gap ratio 是误导性的。论文必须并排呈现绝对值和比率。 (2) 008d reward_gap 2.78× → trained dt_emb 让 reward head 学到了精确的 dt-specific reward predictions, 但这个精确度建立在 RSSM 的 imprecise states 上 → 系统性 reward 过估。 (3) 008f reward_gap 1.01× → no dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2, reward_MAE=0.747 (baseline 75×), 这是 \\\"去掉 dt_emb 代价太大\\\" 的定量证据。 审稿人视此表为 \\\"smoking gun\\\"——不是模型不好，而是 conditioning 让模型在错误的 基础上过于 confident。\\n\"\n822\t  },\n823\t  {\n824\t    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n825\t    \"description\": \"从现有 metrics.jsonl 提取 actor_entropy trajectories。0 GPU cost。\\n\",\n826\t    \"results\": {\n827\t      \"008d_s0_entropy_35K\": -3.465,\n828\t      \"008d_s0_entropy_45K\": -4.575,\n829\t      \"008d_s0_entropy_55K\": -4.879,\n830\t      \"008d_s0_trend\": \"monotonic decrease → policy locks onto overestimated actions\",\n831\t      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_85K\": -5.208,\n832\t      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K\": -4.529,\n833\t      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K\": -3.828,\n834\t      \"008e_v3_s2_trend\": \"increase during collapse → policy destabilizes\",\n835\t      \"008a_s0_entropy_105K_predicted\": -5.1,\n836\t      \"008a_s0_trend\": \"stable convergence to low entropy (normal learning)\",\n837\t      \"baseline_entropy_converged_predicted\": \"-5.2 to -5.5\",\n838\t      \"016e_entropy_comparison\": \"SGS preserves ~1.0-1.3 nats higher entropy through 35-55K\"\n839\t    },\n840\t    \"tables\": [\n841\t      {\n842\t        \"name\": \"Table: Actor Entropy Signatures\",\n843\t        \"columns\": [\n844\t          \"Config\",\n845\t          \"Entropy@35K\",\n846\t          \"Entropy@55K\",\n847\t          \"Entropy@105K\",\n848\t          \"Trend\",\n849\t          \"Classification\"\n850\t        ],\n851\t        \"rows\": [\n852\t          [\n853\t            \"Baseline s0\",\n854\t            \"-4.2\",\n855\t            \"-5.0\",\n856\t            \"-5.3\",\n857\t            \"Converging ↓\",\n858\t            \"Healthy\"\n859\t          ],\n860\t          [\n861\t            \"008a s0 (unexposed)\",\n862\t            \"-3.8\",\n863\t            \"-4.6\",\n864\t            \"-5.1\",\n865\t            \"Converging ↓\",\n866\t            \"Healthy\"\n867\t          ],\n868\t          [\n869\t            \"008d s0 (CIVO)\",\n870\t            \"-3.47\",\n871\t            \"-4.88\",\n872\t            \"—(collapsed)\",\n873\t            \"Accelerating ↓\",\n874\t            \"Pathway A\"\n875\t          ],\n876\t          [\n877\t            \"008e_v3 s2\",\n878\t            \"-5.12\",\n879\t            \"-5.12\",\n880\t            \"-3.83\",\n881\t            \"Rising ↑ at collapse\",\n882\t            \"Pathway B\"\n883\t          ],\n884\t          [\n885\t            \"016e (SGS)\",\n886\t            \"-2.12\",\n887\t            \"-3.62\",\n888\t            \"—(collapsed)\",\n889\t            \"Delayed ↓\",\n890\t            \"SGS-modified CIVO\"\n891\t          ]\n892\t        ]\n893\t      }\n894\t    ],\n895\t    \"figures\": [],\n896\t    \"analysis\": \"Entropy 分析提供了 collapse 动态的独立验证维度。Best 档审稿人将此 视为 mechanism-level claim 的有力 supplementary evidence。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, actor entropy 分析提供了 Pathway A vs B 的独立定量区分。 Pathway A (008d s0): entropy 单调下降 (-3.47 → -4.88) = actor 变得越来越 deterministic，exploit overestimated value regions。这是经典 CIVO 签名。 Pathway B (008e_v3 s2): entropy 上升 (-5.21 → -3.83) = policy 在崩溃期间 变随机，失去已学结构。这与 value-driven exploitation 相反。 健康配置 (008a, baseline): entropy 稳定收敛到 ~-5.2 (正常确定性策略)。 SGS (016e) 的高 entropy (+1.0-1.3 nats) 解释了它为何延迟但不阻止 CIVO: 更多探索暂时抵消了 value overestimation, 但无法永久阻止。 审稿人视此为 Figure 级别的 supporting evidence, 加强了论文的机制性叙事。\\n\"\n897\t  },\n898\t  {\n899\t    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n900\t    \"description\": \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比。1 GPU hour for trajectory collection。\\n\",\n901\t    \"results\": {\n902\t      \"baseline_v_mc_correlation_predicted\": 0.92,\n903\t      \"baseline_v_mc_bias_predicted\": \"+2-5% (slight optimism, normal)\",\n904\t      \"008d_v_mc_correlation_35K_predicted\": 0.71,\n905\t      \"008d_v_mc_correlation_55K_predicted\": 0.38,\n906\t      \"008d_v_mc_bias_55K_predicted\": \"+180% (extreme optimism at dt>1 states)\",\n907\t      \"008d_dt2_specific_bias_predicted\": \"+250% at dt=2 imagined states vs +40% at dt=1\",\n908\t      \"008a_v_mc_correlation_predicted\": 0.85,\n909\t      \"008a_v_mc_bias_predicted\": \"-5% (slight pessimism, consistent with NVE<1.0×)\"\n910\t    },\n911\t    \"tables\": [\n912\t      {\n913\t        \"name\": \"Table: V(s) vs MC Return Statistics\",\n914\t        \"columns\": [\n915\t          \"Config\",\n916\t          \"V-MC correlation\",\n917\t          \"Mean bias\",\n918\t          \"dt>1 specific bias\"\n919\t        ],\n920\t        \"rows\": [\n921\t          [\n922\t            \"Baseline\",\n923\t            \"0.92\",\n924\t            \"+3%\",\n925\t            \"N/A (dt=1 only)\"\n926\t          ],\n927\t          [\n928\t            \"008d@35K\",\n929\t            \"0.71\",\n930\t            \"+85%\",\n931\t            \"+160% at dt=2\"\n932\t          ],\n933\t          [\n934\t            \"008d@55K\",\n935\t            \"0.38\",\n936\t            \"+180%\",\n937\t            \"+250% at dt=2\"\n938\t          ],\n939\t          [\n940\t            \"008a@105K\",\n941\t            \"0.85\",\n942\t            \"-5%\",\n943\t            \"N/A (unexposed)\"\n944\t          ]\n945\t        ]\n946\t      }\n947\t    ],\n948\t    \"figures\": [],\n949\t    \"analysis\": \"P2 优先级, 但若完成则显著加强 C2 的 mechanistic depth。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, distributional analysis 升级了 v/e ratio proxy 的说服力。 关键发现: 008d 的 value overestimation 不是 uniform 的——它集中在 dt>1 imagined states (+250%), 而 dt=1 states 仅有 +40% 偏差。这直接证明了 trained dt_embedding + RSSM fidelity gap 的交互效应。 008a 的轻微 pessimism (-5%) 与 NVE<1.0× 一致，说明 unexposed dt_emb 实际上倾向于 underestimate value (safe bias)。 审稿人视此为 \\\"beyond a crude proxy\\\" (preempt R3) 的关键补充分析。 如果时间不足, best 档 narrative 中 v/e ratio proxy 仍被接受 (R3 被 preempt by the 4/4 NVE threshold + AUROC analysis)。\\n\"\n950\t  },\n951\t  {\n952\t    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n953\t    \"description\": \"跟踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding vectors 在训练过程中的分离。0 GPU cost。\\n\",\n954\t    \"results\": {\n955\t      \"initial_cosine_sim_predicted\": 0.02,\n956\t      \"cosine_sim_15K_predicted\": -0.12,\n957\t      \"cosine_sim_35K_predicted\": -0.38,\n958\t      \"cosine_sim_55K_predicted\": -0.52,\n959\t      \"cosine_sim_105K_predicted\": -0.61,\n960\t      \"embedding_norm_ratio_dt2_vs_dt1_predicted\": 1.34,\n961\t      \"divergence_onset_predicted\": \"10-15K (coincides with reward head learning dt-specific predictions)\",\n962\t      \"frozen_cosine_sim_predicted\": 0.02,\n963\t      \"008f_predicted\": \"N/A (dt_embed_dim=0)\"\n964\t    },\n965\t    \"tables\": [\n966\t      {\n967\t        \"name\": \"Table: dt_embedding Cosine Similarity Evolution\",\n968\t        \"columns\": [\n969\t          \"Step\",\n970\t          \"cos(emb_dt1, emb_dt2)\",\n971\t          \"||emb_dt2|| / ||emb_dt1||\"\n972\t        ],\n973\t        \"rows\": [\n974\t          [\n975\t            \"0 (init)\",\n976\t            \"0.02\",\n977\t            \"1.00\"\n978\t          ],\n979\t          [\n980\t            \"15K\",\n981\t            \"-0.12\",\n982\t            \"1.08\"\n983\t          ],\n984\t          [\n985\t            \"35K\",\n986\t            \"-0.38\",\n987\t            \"1.21\"\n988\t          ],\n989\t          [\n990\t            \"55K\",\n991\t            \"-0.52\",\n992\t            \"1.30\"\n993\t          ],\n994\t          [\n995\t            \"105K\",\n996\t            \"-0.61\",\n997\t            \"1.34\"\n998\t          ]\n999\t        ]\n1000\t      }\n1001\t    ],\n1002\t    \"figures\": [],\n1003\t    \"analysis\": \"P2 supplementary analysis。Embedding divergence 与 CIVO onset 的时间相关性 提供了额外的 mechanistic link。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, embedding cosine similarity 提供了 trained dt_emb 如何 diverge 的 可视化证据。dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 从近似随机 (cos~0) 分化到显著负相关 (cos~-0.5 to -0.6)。分化 onset (~15K) 与 reward head 开始区分 dt=1/dt=2 的时间一致 (RSSM fidelity 表中 008d reward_gap 从 15K 开始明显 > 1.0)。 Embedding norm ratio >1 表明 dt=2 embedding 的幅度更大——可能因为 RSSM 需要更强的 conditioning signal 来处理较大的 temporal gap。 审稿人视此为 minor supplementary analysis。不会改变论文的核心评估， 但为 appendix/supplementary 提供了有用的可视化。\\n\"\n1004\t  },\n1005\t  {\n1006\t    \"name\": \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\",\n1007\t    \"description\": \"从所有已完成实验计算 NVE 分类性能。0 GPU cost。AUROC + Youden-optimal threshold。\\n\",\n1008\t    \"results\": {\n1009\t      \"total_data_points\": 29,\n1010\t      \"environments\": 4,\n1011\t      \"AUROC\": 0.969,\n1012\t      \"threshold_sweep\": {\n1013\t        \"t1.0\": {\n1014\t          \"sensitivity\": 1.0,\n1015\t          \"specificity\": 0.72,\n1016\t          \"accuracy\": 0.83,\n1017\t          \"youden_J\": 0.72\n1018\t        },\n1019\t        \"t1.2\": {\n1020\t          \"sensitivity\": 0.96,\n1021\t          \"specificity\": 0.86,\n1022\t          \"accuracy\": 0.9,\n1023\t          \"youden_J\": 0.82\n1024\t        },\n1025\t        \"t1.3\": {\n1026\t          \"sensitivity\": 0.93,\n1027\t          \"specificity\": 0.93,\n1028\t          \"accuracy\": 0.93,\n1029\t          \"youden_J\": 0.86\n1030\t        },\n1031\t        \"t1.5\": {\n1032\t          \"sensitivity\": 0.93,\n1033\t          \"specificity\": 0.97,\n1034\t          \"accuracy\": 0.95,\n1035\t          \"youden_J\": 0.9\n1036\t        },\n1037\t        \"t1.7\": {\n1038\t          \"sensitivity\": 0.86,\n1039\t          \"specificity\": 1.0,\n1040\t          \"accuracy\": 0.93,\n1041\t          \"youden_J\": 0.86\n1042\t        },\n1043\t        \"t2.0\": {\n1044\t          \"sensitivity\": 0.75,\n1045\t          \"specificity\": 1.0,\n1046\t          \"accuracy\": 0.88,\n1047\t          \"youden_J\": 0.75\n1048\t        }\n1049\t      },\n1050\t      \"youden_optimal_threshold\": 1.53,\n1051\t      \"youden_optimal_J\": 0.905,\n1052\t      \"classification_at_1.5x\": {\n1053\t        \"true_positives\": 13,\n1054\t        \"true_negatives\": 14,\n1055\t        \"false_positives\": 1,\n1056\t        \"false_negatives\": 1\n1057\t      }\n1058\t    },\n1059\t    \"tables\": [\n1060\t      {\n1061\t        \"name\": \"Table: NVE Threshold Sensitivity (AUROC=0.969)\",\n1062\t        \"columns\": [\n1063\t          \"Threshold\",\n1064\t          \"Sensitivity\",\n1065\t          \"Specificity\",\n1066\t          \"Accuracy\",\n1067\t          \"Youden J\"\n1068\t        ],\n1069\t        \"rows\": [\n1070\t          [\n1071\t            \"1.0×\",\n1072\t            \"1.00\",\n1073\t            \"0.72\",\n1074\t            \"0.83\",\n1075\t            \"0.72\"\n1076\t          ],\n1077\t          [\n1078\t            \"1.2×\",\n1079\t            \"0.96\",\n1080\t            \"0.86\",\n1081\t            \"0.90\",\n1082\t            \"0.82\"\n1083\t          ],\n1084\t          [\n1085\t            \"1.3×\",\n1086\t            \"0.93\",\n1087\t            \"0.93\",\n1088\t            \"0.93\",\n1089\t            \"0.86\"\n1090\t          ],\n1091\t          [\n1092\t            \"**1.5×**\",\n1093\t            \"**0.93**\",\n1094\t            \"**0.97**\",\n1095\t            \"**0.95**\",\n1096\t            \"**0.90**\"\n1097\t          ],\n1098\t          [\n1099\t            \"1.7×\",\n1100\t            \"0.86\",\n1101\t            \"1.00\",\n1102\t            \"0.93\",\n1103\t            \"0.86\"\n1104\t          ],\n1105\t          [\n1106\t            \"2.0×\",\n1107\t            \"0.75\",\n1108\t            \"1.00\",\n1109\t            \"0.88\",\n1110\t            \"0.75\"\n1111\t          ]\n1112\t        ]\n1113\t      },\n1114\t      {\n1115\t        \"name\": \"Table: Youden-Optimal Analysis\",\n1116\t        \"columns\": [\n1117\t          \"Metric\",\n1118\t          \"Value\"\n1119\t        ],\n1120\t        \"rows\": [\n1121\t          [\n1122\t            \"AUROC\",\n1123\t            \"0.969\"\n1124\t          ],\n1125\t          [\n1126\t            \"Youden-optimal threshold\",\n1127\t            \"1.53×\"\n1128\t          ],\n1129\t          [\n1130\t            \"Preselected threshold\",\n1131\t            \"1.50×\"\n1132\t          ],\n1133\t          [\n1134\t            \"Convergence gap\",\n1135\t            \"0.03× (2%)\"\n1136\t          ],\n1137\t          [\n1138\t            \"N data points\",\n1139\t            \"29\"\n1140\t          ],\n1141\t          [\n1142\t            \"N environments\",\n1143\t            \"4\"\n1144\t          ]\n1145\t        ]\n1146\t      }\n1147\t    ],\n1148\t    \"figures\": [],\n1149\t    \"analysis\": \"NVE 诊断的定量基础。AUROC 0.969 + Youden 独立收敛是论文最强的方法论贡献之一。 Best 档审稿人接受 with caveat (in-sample), 不降级为 major weakness。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛到 1.53× 化解了 in-sample calibration 质疑 (R10)。审稿人认可: (1) Youden-optimal 1.53× 与预设 1.5× 的独立收敛不是 overfitting——如果 threshold 是 post-hoc 选择, Youden optimal 不太可能恰好落在同一位置。 (2) 4 环境 × 多 config 提供了 reasonable diversity, 尽管仍是 in-sample。 (3) 1-2 个 borderline cases (false positive/negative) 的存在反而增加可信度—— perfect 分类在小样本下更像 overfitting。 审稿人建议 held-out validation 作为 future work, 但不作为 major weakness。 NVE 在不同 reward scale 下的 generalization boundary 被明确讨论 (Cheetah NVE peaks 远高于 Walker, 但 threshold 仍有效分类)。\\n\"\n1150\t  },\n1151\t  {\n1152\t    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n1153\t    \"description\": \"第三 locomotion 环境。P2 优先级。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n1154\t    \"results\": {\n1155\t      \"baseline\": {\n1156\t        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 232.4,\n1157\t        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 178.6,\n1158\t        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 256.8,\n1159\t        \"mean_predicted\": 222.6,\n1160\t        \"std_predicted\": 40.1,\n1161\t        \"ve_ratio_converged_predicted\": \"0.55-0.65\"\n1162\t      },\n1163\t      \"civo_trigger\": {\n1164\t        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 45.3,\n1165\t        \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 5.62,\n1166\t        \"seed0_collapse_predicted\": true,\n1167\t        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 123.8,\n1168\t        \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 2.31,\n1169\t        \"seed1_collapse_predicted\": false,\n1170\t        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 31.7,\n1171\t        \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 7.84,\n1172\t        \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n1173\t        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"3/3\",\n1174\t        \"cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted\": \"2/3\"\n1175\t      },\n1176\t      \"no_dt_emb\": {\n1177\t        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 72.5,\n1178\t        \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.31,\n1179\t        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 58.3,\n1180\t        \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.25,\n1181\t        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 84.1,\n1182\t        \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.38,\n1183\t        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"0/3\",\n1184\t        \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"32.2%\"\n1185\t      }\n1186\t    },\n1187\t    \"tables\": [\n1188\t      {\n1189\t        \"name\": \"Table: Hopper Hop 3×3 Summary (predicted)\",\n1190\t        \"columns\": [\n1191\t          \"Config\",\n1192\t          \"Eval mean\",\n1193\t          \"NVE>1.5× rate\",\n1194\t          \"Collapse rate\",\n1195\t          \"Baseline%\"\n1196\t        ],\n1197\t        \"rows\": [\n1198\t          [\n1199\t            \"Baseline\",\n1200\t            \"222.6\",\n1201\t            \"0/3\",\n1202\t            \"0/3\",\n1203\t            \"100%\"\n1204\t          ],\n1205\t          [\n1206\t            \"CIVO trigger\",\n1207\t            \"66.9\",\n1208\t            \"3/3\",\n1209\t            \"2/3\",\n1210\t            \"30.1%\"\n1211\t          ],\n1212\t          [\n1213\t            \"No dt_emb\",\n1214\t            \"71.6\",\n1215\t            \"0/3\",\n1216\t            \"0/3\",\n1217\t            \"32.2%\"\n1218\t          ]\n1219\t        ]\n1220\t      }\n1221\t    ],\n1222\t    \"figures\": [],\n1223\t    \"analysis\": \"P2 但若完成则为论文最强 generalization evidence。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Hopper Hop 是 P2 额外验证——论文叙事不依赖它, 但若完成则强化 generalization claim。Hopper 是较难的 locomotion task (DreamerV3 baseline ~180-260), seed variance 较大 (CV ~18%) 因为 hopping 任务对 policy 细微差异更敏感。 CIVO trigger 预测遵循 Walker 模式: 3/3 NVE>1.5×, 2/3 collapse。 NVE severity (2-8×) 介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-70×) 之间, 反映 Hopper dynamics 的中等复杂度。 No-dt-emb 预测 0/3 CIVO, eval ~32% baseline (类似 Walker/Cartpole)。 若完成, 跨环境 CIVO prevention 总计: Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + PickCube 0/1 + Cartpole 0/3 + Hopper 0/3 = 0/14。 但 best 档审稿人已接受 3 环境足够——Hopper 是 bonus。\\n\"\n1224\t  },\n1225\t  {\n1226\t    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\",\n1227\t    \"description\": \"P1 探索性实验: RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination rollout。 Walker Walk, dt=2, 1 seed。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n1228\t    \"results\": {\n1229\t      \"eval_105K_predicted\": 485.3,\n1230\t      \"nve_peak_predicted\": 1.42,\n1231\t      \"nve_105K_predicted\": 0.73,\n1232\t      \"collapse_predicted\": false,\n1233\t      \"civo_prevented_predicted\": true,\n1234\t      \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"53.0%\",\n1235\t      \"effective_horizon_mean_predicted\": 9.2,\n1236\t      \"effective_horizon_std_predicted\": 3.4,\n1237\t      \"truncation_trigger_rate_predicted\": \"38% of rollout steps\",\n1238\t      \"value_calibration_predicted\": \"moderate underestimation (NVE 0.6-0.8×)\"\n1239\t    },\n1240\t    \"tables\": [\n1241\t      {\n1242\t        \"name\": \"Table: Uncertainty-Gated Truncation Pilot\",\n1243\t        \"columns\": [\n1244\t          \"Metric\",\n1245\t          \"Value\",\n1246\t          \"Comparison\"\n1247\t        ],\n1248\t        \"rows\": [\n1249\t          [\n1250\t            \"Eval@105K\",\n1251\t            \"485.3\",\n1252\t            \"53% baseline (vs TCN σ=0.2 68%)\"\n1253\t          ],\n1254\t          [\n1255\t            \"NVE_peak\",\n1256\t            \"1.42\",\n1257\t            \"Below 1.5× threshold\"\n1258\t          ],\n1259\t          [\n1260\t            \"Mean effective horizon\",\n1261\t            \"9.2/15\",\n1262\t            \"Truncation reduces useful imagination\"\n1263\t          ],\n1264\t          [\n1265\t            \"Truncation trigger rate\",\n1266\t            \"38%\",\n1267\t            \"RSSM uncertain at 38% of steps\"\n1268\t          ]\n1269\t        ]\n1270\t      }\n1271\t    ],\n1272\t    \"figures\": [],\n1273\t    \"analysis\": \"Pilot 结果支持 \\\"CIVO prevention ↔ learning quality trade-off\\\" 的系统性发现。 可选添加到 Intervention Hierarchy 作为 L4, 但非论文核心。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, uncertainty-gated truncation 是 Intervention Hierarchy 的潜在第四层 (Model-based gating)。预测它部分有效: NVE 保持 <1.5× (CIVO technically prevented), 但 eval 仅 53% baseline (truncation 过于激进, 缩短了有效 imagination horizon)。 这类似于 TCN 的困境: 足以阻止 CIVO 的干预强度也损害了学习。 Truncation rate 38% 表明 RSSM 在相当多的 rollout steps 上不确定——这本身 就是 RSSM fidelity gap 的直接度量。 审稿人可能将此视为 \\\"interesting pilot but needs more investigation\\\"——P1 定位合理, 不会升级为论文核心贡献, 但为 future work 提供了具体方向。 如果添加到 Intervention Hierarchy: L4 (Model-based): Uncertainty truncation 1/1 prevents CIVO but 53% eval retention. 与 L3 TCN (2/8, 45-91% retention) 互补: 不同机制, 类似 trade-off。\\n\"\n1274\t  },\n1275\t  {\n1276\t    \"name\": \"Aggregate: Intervention Hierarchy Final Table\",\n1277\t    \"description\": \"论文核心 Table: 所有干预方法的系统性评估汇总。整合 C7 + C8 全部数据。\\n\",\n1278\t    \"results\": {\n1279\t      \"total_seeds_tested\": 42,\n1280\t      \"total_methods\": 8,\n1281\t      \"total_levels\": 3,\n1282\t      \"total_environments\": 3,\n1283\t      \"overall_CIVO_prevention_rate\": \"4/36 (11.1%) — excluding embedding removal control\",\n1284\t      \"embedding_removal_rate\": \"8/8 (100%) — removes the feature entirely\"\n1285\t    },\n1286\t    \"tables\": [\n1287\t      {\n1288\t        \"name\": \"Table (论文核心): Intervention Hierarchy\",\n1289\t        \"columns\": [\n1290\t          \"Level\",\n1291\t          \"Method\",\n1292\t          \"Success rate\",\n1293\t          \"Best eval retention\",\n1294\t          \"Primary failure mechanism\"\n1295\t        ],\n1296\t        \"rows\": [\n1297\t          [\n1298\t            \"L1 Gradient\",\n1299\t            \"Full SGS\",\n1300\t            \"0/3\",\n1301\t            \"49%\",\n1302\t            \"Forward-pass damage irreducible\"\n1303\t          ],\n1304\t          [\n1305\t            \"L1 Gradient\",\n1306\t            \"Obs-decoder SGS\",\n1307\t            \"1/6\",\n1308\t            \"79% (but critic destroyed)\",\n1309\t            \"Compensatory amplification\"\n1310\t          ],\n1311\t          [\n1312\t            \"L1 Gradient\",\n1313\t            \"Reward SGS\",\n1314\t            \"0/2\",\n1315\t            \"36%\",\n1316\t            \"No-op (gradient ≠ causality)\"\n1317\t          ],\n1318\t          [\n1319\t            \"L2 Output\",\n1320\t            \"RAVE ceil=2.0\",\n1321\t            \"0/1\",\n1322\t            \"3%\",\n1323\t            \"EMA anchor pollution\"\n1324\t          ],\n1325\t          [\n1326\t            \"L2 Output\",\n1327\t            \"RAVE ceil=1.5\",\n1328\t            \"0/1\",\n1329\t            \"8%\",\n1330\t            \"EMA anchor pollution\"\n1331\t          ],\n1332\t          [\n1333\t            \"L3 Representation\",\n1334\t            \"TCN σ=0.2\",\n1335\t            \"2/8*\",\n1336\t            \"91%/45% (high variance)\",\n1337\t            \"Dose insufficient in complex envs\"\n1338\t          ],\n1339\t          [\n1340\t            \"L3 Representation\",\n1341\t            \"TCN σ=0.5\",\n1342\t            \"0/3\",\n1343\t            \"40%\",\n1344\t            \"Overdose (Walker) / Underdose (Cheetah)\"\n1345\t          ],\n1346\t          [\n1347\t            \"L3 Representation\",\n1348\t            \"TCN σ=1.0\",\n1349\t            \"1/1†\",\n1350\t            \"27%\",\n1351\t            \"Learning destroyed by noise\"\n1352\t          ],\n1353\t          [\n1354\t            \"**Control**\",\n1355\t            \"**dt_emb removal**\",\n1356\t            \"**8/8**\",\n1357\t            \"**15-37%**\",\n1358\t            \"**(removes feature)**\"\n1359\t          ]\n1360\t        ]\n1361\t      }\n1362\t    ],\n1363\t    \"figures\": [],\n1364\t    \"analysis\": \"论文最重要的 contribution table。Best 档审稿人将此视为 \\\"systematic negative results that save the community significant wasted effort\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Intervention Hierarchy 被认可为系统性贡献。审稿人看到的是: 8 种方法, 3 个干预层级, 3 个环境, 42 seeds——这是该类问题的首次系统性评估。 关键 narrative: 论文不是 \\\"我们试了一个方法失败了\\\", 而是 \\\"我们系统性地探索了 整个干预空间, 发现 CIVO fundamentally hard to mitigate through post-hoc interventions\\\"。 Gradient level (L1) 失败因为 forward-pass damage 不可逆; Output level (L2) 失败因为 EMA anchor 被污染; Representation level (L3) 在最优条件下偶尔成功但不可靠。 唯一 100% 有效的方法是移除 feature 本身——这不是 intervention, 是 surrender。 这为 future work 提供了明确方向: 需要 architectural solutions (THICK/Hieros 式分层时间抽象), 而非 post-hoc patches。\\n\"\n1365\t  },\n1366\t  {\n1367\t    \"name\": \"Aggregate: NVE Cross-Environment Classification\",\n1368\t    \"description\": \"NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境汇总。\\n\",\n1369\t    \"results\": {\n1370\t      \"walker_trained_above_1.5x\": \"5/5 (008d s0-s4)\",\n1371\t      \"walker_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/7 (008f s0-s4 + 008a s0-s2)\",\n1372\t      \"cheetah_trained_above_1.5x\": \"3/3 (010b s0-s1 + predicted s2)\",\n1373\t      \"cheetah_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/5 (024b s0-s1 + 008a_cheetah s0-s1 + predicted)\",\n1374\t      \"pickcube_trained_above_1.5x\": \"1/1 (019b)\",\n1375\t      \"pickcube_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/0 (no control run)\",\n1376\t      \"total_AUROC\": 0.969,\n1377\t      \"total_sensitivity\": 0.93,\n1378\t      \"total_specificity\": 0.97\n1379\t    },\n1380\t    \"tables\": [\n1381\t      {\n1382\t        \"name\": \"Table: NVE Cross-Environment Summary\",\n1383\t        \"columns\": [\n1384\t          \"Environment\",\n1385\t          \"Trained dt_emb NVE>1.5×\",\n1386\t          \"Untrained NVE>1.5×\",\n1387\t          \"Max NVE (trained)\"\n1388\t        ],\n1389\t        \"rows\": [\n1390\t          [\n1391\t            \"Walker Walk\",\n1392\t            \"5/5\",\n1393\t            \"0/7\",\n1394\t            \"4.12×\"\n1395\t          ],\n1396\t          [\n1397\t            \"Cheetah Run\",\n1398\t            \"3/3\",\n1399\t            \"0/5\",\n1400\t            \"70.64×\"\n1401\t          ],\n1402\t          [\n1403\t            \"PickCube\",\n1404\t            \"1/1\",\n1405\t            \"—\",\n1406\t            \"3.78×\"\n1407\t          ],\n1408\t          [\n1409\t            \"**Total**\",\n1410\t            \"**9/9**\",\n1411\t            \"**0/12**\",\n1412\t            \"—\"\n1413\t          ]\n1414\t        ]\n1415\t      }\n1416\t    ],\n1417\t    \"figures\": [],\n1418\t    \"analysis\": \"NVE 诊断方法的 cross-environment robustness confirmation。\\n\\nBest 档下, NVE 跨环境分类汇总是论文 C2 的 capstone evidence。 Trained dt_emb → NVE>1.5× 在 9/9+ 个 independent observations 中成立 (部分 seeds 共享 seed number, 需去重)。Untrained → 0/12+ 超过 1.5×。 AUROC 0.969 在 4 环境 29 data points 上成立, 尽管是 in-sample。 审稿人接受 NVE≥1.5× 作为 \\\"reliable early-warning diagnostic for CIVO risk in temporal-abstraction world-model RL\\\", 建议 held-out validation 作为 future work。\\n\"\n1419\t  }\n1420\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b43cb053-f1a6-4be1-a135-86a71baad7c6","uuid":"bf938e4f-79c9-4689-a28f-2a2e319d00b7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:27:12.845Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T210241/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"复现 CIVO collapse 的多 seed 验证。008d 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, trained dt_emb, H=8)。 Registry 已完成: 009e (s1) + 009b (s2)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 131.08,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 4.12,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_step\": 55000,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed1_collapse_type\": \"classic_CIVO_value_driven\",\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 267.93,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 2.05,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_step\": 25000,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed2_self_correction\": true,\n      \"seed2_nve_final\": 0.38,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"2/2\",\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2\",\n      \"independent_collapse_rate\": \"1/2 (008d s0 与 009e s1 共享 seed=1, 视为同一观测)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Walker 008d Cross-Seed Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"NVE_peak_step\",\n          \"Collapse?\",\n          \"Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0 (008d)\",\n            \"82.75\",\n            \"4.12\",\n            \"55K\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Value-driven, entropy ↓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1 (009e)\",\n            \"131.08\",\n            \"4.12\",\n            \"55K\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Same seed as s0, deterministic replication\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2 (009b)\",\n            \"267.93\",\n            \"2.05\",\n            \"25K\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Transient NVE → self-correction\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C2 核心证据：trained dt_emb 可靠触发 NVE>1.5× (2/2 independent seeds)。 Collapse 是 stochastic (1/2)，但 diagnostic marker 是 deterministic。 Best 档审稿人接受这一区分，不要求 deterministic collapse。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 2/2 trained dt_emb seeds 均超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 CIVO 诊断标记的 强 supporting evidence。审稿人理解 collapse 是 stochastic 的——关键发现不是 \\\"必然崩溃\\\" 而是 \\\"trained dt_emb 可靠触发病态过估值 (NVE>1.5×)\\\"。 Seed 1 的经典 CIVO (value-driven, entropy ↓, NVE 1.78→2.09→4.12 加速) vs Seed 2 的自我修正 (NVE 2.05→1.62→0.38 衰减) 被视为丰富了 CIVO 动态的理解， 而非削弱了 claim。Sustained vs transient NVE>1.5× 的差异性（seed 1 连续3个 checkpoint 维持>1.5× → 不可逆; seed 2 仅一次突破 → 自我修正）与 Henderson et al. 2018 的早期随机性影响结论一致。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"C2 因果控制的多 seed 验证。008f 配置 (dt=2, subsample ON, dt_embed_dim=0, H=8)。 Registry: 009f (s1) killed → 使用替代 seeds (008f_s3, 008f_s4); 009c (s2) done。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 148.34,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 1.26,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 1.14,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 363.8,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak\": \"<1.5x\",\n      \"seed3_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed4_eval_105K\": 306.5,\n      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 1.41,\n      \"seed4_nve_105K\": 0.58,\n      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"reward_MAE_baseline_ratio\": \"~75x\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 008f Causal Control Cross-Seed\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"NVE@105K\",\n          \"CIVO?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0 (008f)\",\n            \"503\",\n            \"1.02\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2 (009c)\",\n            \"148.34\",\n            \"1.26\",\n            \"1.14\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s3\",\n            \"363.8\",\n            \"<1.5\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s4\",\n            \"306.5\",\n            \"1.41\",\n            \"0.58\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"与 008d 2/2 对比，形成 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的完美二分类。 Best 档审稿人视 008f 为 \\\"definitive causal control\\\"，008f 的低 eval 被理解为 因果控制实验的预期代价。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 0/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× 被接受为 dt_embedding 因果控制的决定性证据。 与 008d 的 2/2 形成 5/5 完美分离（trained 2/2 exceed, untrained 0/3 never exceed）。 审稿人注意到 009c 的 NVE=1.14@105K 接近但未达 1.5× threshold，且 008f_s4 的 transient NVE=1.41@85K 也在 threshold 以下——threshold 的区分力成立。 008f reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75×）是已知 trade-off: 去掉 dt_embedding 后 reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2。审稿人接受这不削弱因果结论——因果控制实验证明的是 \\\"去掉 X → 无崩溃\\\"，不需要 reward 预测同样好。R8 被 preempt。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"C3 value growth suppression 多 seed 验证。008a 配置 (dt=2, subsample OFF, trained dt_emb unexposed to dt>1 data, H=15)。Registry 已完成: 008a_unexposed_s1, s2。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 630.91,\n      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.43,\n      \"seed1_civo_alert\": 0,\n      \"seed1_delta_ve\": -0.0028,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 899.4,\n      \"seed2_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.333,\n      \"seed2_civo_alert\": 0,\n      \"seed2_delta_ve\": -0.003,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/2\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 765.2,\n      \"cross_seed_eval_range\": \"631-899\",\n      \"vs_baseline_mean\": \"83.5%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 008a Unexposed Cross-Seed\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"VE ratio@105K\",\n          \"NVE@105K\",\n          \"Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0 (008a)\",\n            \"777.66\",\n            \"0.386\",\n            \"0.59\",\n            \"Zigzag recovery, 2 V-cycles\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"630.91\",\n            \"0.43\",\n            \"~0.65\",\n            \"Rising trend\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"899.4\",\n            \"0.333\",\n            \"~0.51\",\n            \"Strong convergence, near-baseline\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3 核心证据加强。3 seeds 一致展现 value suppression (NVE 0.51-0.65x)。 高 seed variance (631-899) 被理解为 dt>1 数据缺失导致的学习不稳定， 而非方法论缺陷。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, unexposed dt_emb（trained 但训练数据中无 dt>1 transition）的两个新 seed 均展现 value suppression + 无 CIVO。Seed 2 特别强 (899.4 = 98% baseline)。 Cross-seed 均值 765 (83.5% baseline) 显著优于 008f (均值 ~330, 36% baseline)。 审稿人将此解读为: 真正有害的不是 dt_embedding 本身的存在，而是当 training data 中含有 dt>1 transitions 时 dt_embedding 学到 dt-specific representations。 这强化了 C2 的机制性解释（RSSM fidelity gap + learned conditioning amplification）， 而非简单的 \\\"有 dt_emb = 坏\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\",\n    \"description\": \"C6 dt=1 imagination 效果验证。008e_v3 配置 (trained dt_emb, dt=1 imagination, subsample ON, H=15)。Registry 已完成: s1 (success), s2 (collapsed non-CIVO)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 869.88,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.8,\n      \"seed1_ve_ratio_105K\": 0.527,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": false,\n      \"seed1_gate_dt_1_frac\": 1.0,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K\": 136.96,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak\": 3.78,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K\": 3.78,\n      \"seed2_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_collapse_onset\": \"95K\",\n      \"seed2_actor_entropy_trend\": \"rising (-5.21@85K → -3.83@105K)\",\n      \"seed2_gate_dt_1_frac\": 1.0,\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"1/2\",\n      \"collapse_mechanism_difference\": \"seed2 = eval-driven (Pathway B), not value-driven (Pathway A)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Pathway A vs Pathway B Collapse Dynamics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"008d s0 (Pathway A)\",\n          \"008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Value change\",\n            \"Explosive (60→138, +130%@55K)\",\n            \"Moderate (339→384→340, +13%→-12%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Eval change\",\n            \"Post-value (146→83, -43%)\",\n            \"Leads (715→452→137, -81%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NVE driver\",\n            \"Value numerator (value explosion)\",\n            \"Eval denominator (eval crash)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Actor entropy\",\n            \"↓ (-3.47→-4.88, policy locks)\",\n            \"↑ (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizes)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mechanism\",\n            \"Critic overestimate → actor exploit\",\n            \"Eval crash → value lag\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C6 从 \\\"practical mitigation\\\" 降级为 \\\"mechanistic insight: trained dt_emb 创建 多条脆弱通道\\\"。Best 档审稿人视此为 honest reporting + deeper understanding， 而非 weakness。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 被透明报告并获审稿人认可。dt=1 imagination 不能阻止崩溃 (1/2 seeds)，但崩溃机制与经典 CIVO 定性不同： - 008d s0 (Pathway A): value 爆炸 → actor exploit → eval 下跌，entropy ↓ - 008e_v3 s2 (Pathway B): eval 先跌 → NVE 被动升高，entropy ↑ (策略变随机) 审稿人接受 \\\"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability through multiple pathways\\\" 这一更深层洞察。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定 (618→596→836)，排除 seed 脆弱假说。这实际上丰富了论文贡献——CIVO 不是唯一的脆弱通道。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\",\n    \"description\": \"诊断 dt_emb TRAINING 是否为 CIVO 必要条件。dt_embedding 保持随机初始化但 freeze (requires_grad=False)。Registry 已完成: exp_015b。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"eval_105K\": 204.2,\n      \"nve_85K\": 0.467,\n      \"nve_95K\": 0.394,\n      \"nve_105K\": 0.42,\n      \"collapse\": false,\n      \"actor_loss_105K\": 0.000179,\n      \"actor_entropy_105K\": -4.855,\n      \"value_mean_105K\": 56.212,\n      \"gate_dt_mean\": 2.0,\n      \"collapse_mechanism\": \"gradient_starvation_from_frozen_dt_emb\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: dt_emb 2×2 Ablation Matrix\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Config\",\n          \"dt_emb state\",\n          \"Exposed to dt>1?\",\n          \"CIVO?\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE range\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"008d\",\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"Yes (subsample ON)\",\n            \"Yes (2/2)\",\n            \"82-131\",\n            \"1.71-4.12\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008a\",\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"No (subsample OFF)\",\n            \"No (0/3)\",\n            \"631-899\",\n            \"0.51-0.65\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008f\",\n            \"Removed (dim=0)\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"No (0/4)\",\n            \"148-503\",\n            \"0.30-1.41\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"015b\",\n            \"Frozen (random init)\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"No (0/1)\",\n            \"204\",\n            \"0.39-0.47\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"闭合因果推理: dt_emb training + exposure to dt>1 data 两个条件同时满足时才触发 CIVO。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, frozen dt_emb 不崩溃但性能很差 (204 = 22% baseline)。NVE 全程 0.39-0.47 (远低于 1.0×, critic 严重低估)，actor_loss → 0（梯度饥饿）。这确认了 dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是 CIVO 的必要条件——没有训练的 dt_embedding 只是噪声输入， 不会创建 RSSM 对精确 dt 信号的 co-adaptation。但 frozen embedding 引入了 新问题（梯度饥饿），证明这不是一个可行的 mitigation 方向。 审稿人将此视为 2×2 消融矩阵 (008a/008d/008f/015b) 的完成： - 008d (trained + subsample ON): CIVO ✓ - 008a (trained + subsample OFF): No CIVO ✓ (unexposed) - 008f (removed, subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (no embedding) - 015b (frozen + subsample ON): No CIVO ✓ (frozen) 只有 008d (trained AND exposed to dt>1 data) 产生 CIVO → training 是必要条件。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\",\n    \"description\": \"缩小 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) 崩溃概率估计区间。Registry 已完成: s3 + s4。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed3_eval_105K\": 92.7,\n      \"seed3_nve_peak\": 4.02,\n      \"seed3_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed3_collapse_onset\": \"85K-95K\",\n      \"seed3_actor_entropy_final\": -4.892,\n      \"seed4_eval_105K\": 899.3,\n      \"seed4_nve_peak\": 0.99,\n      \"seed4_collapse\": false,\n      \"total_008e_v3_collapse_rate\": \"2/4 (50%)\",\n      \"collapse_pathway_breakdown\": \"s2 = Pathway B (eval-driven, entropy ↑); s3 = mixed (entropy remains low)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 008e_v3 Cross-Seed Summary (dt=1 imagination)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"Collapse?\",\n          \"Pathway\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s1 (008e_v3)\",\n            \"869.9\",\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Healthy\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"137.0\",\n            \"3.78\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"B (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s3\",\n            \"92.7\",\n            \"4.02\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Mixed (entropy stays low)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s4\",\n            \"899.3\",\n            \"0.99\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Healthy\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"50% collapse rate 确认 dt=1 imagination 非有效 mitigation。Best 档审稿人 视此为诚实报告 + 对 trained dt_emb 多通道脆弱性的系统性证据。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, 2/4 崩溃率 (50%) 与 008d 的 1/2 (50%) 完全一致——dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。这是 C6 PARTIALLY FALSIFIED 的最有力量化证据。 s3 崩溃 (NVE 4.02, entropy stays low at -4.892) 引入了第三种可能的动态模式， 但 best 档审稿人不要求对每个 seed 的机制差异做完整解释——4 seeds 确认 50% 崩溃率已经足够。核心结论: trained dt_embedding 是根本脆弱源，dt=1 imagination 只消除了一条特定通道 (Pathway A) 但不消除全部通道。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"第二 DMC 环境基准线。Registry 已有 5 seeds (023a/023b/023_s2/s3/s4)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_final\": 624.7,\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 520.3,\n      \"seed2_eval_final\": 645.4,\n      \"seed3_eval_final\": 642.13,\n      \"seed4_eval_final\": 537.03,\n      \"cross_seed_mean\": 593.9,\n      \"cross_seed_std\": 56.8,\n      \"cross_seed_range\": \"520-645\",\n      \"ve_ratio_converged\": \"0.65-0.70\",\n      \"ve_ratio_stable_from\": \"150K+\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Baseline Cross-Seed\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval final\",\n          \"Peak eval\",\n          \"VE ratio converged\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"624.7\",\n            \"624.7\",\n            \"~0.67\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"520.3\",\n            \"572.9\",\n            \"~0.65\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"645.4\",\n            \"645.4\",\n            \"~0.68\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s3\",\n            \"642.1\",\n            \"685.9\",\n            \"~0.69\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s4\",\n            \"537.0 (ext→642)\",\n            \"642.3\",\n            \"~0.66\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Robust baseline。Cross-seed IQM ~600，用于所有 Cheetah CIVO 实验的归一化。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah baseline 提供了 NVE 归一化的可靠分母。5 seeds 的一致性 (std=56.8, CV=9.6%) 表明 Cheetah 环境有适度但可接受的 seed variance。 VE ratio 收敛到 0.65-0.70 (类似 Walker 的 0.69-0.72)，支持 NVE 归一化方法 在跨环境的适用性。审稿人接受 5 seeds 足够建立可靠 baseline。 s4 的 194K→204K eval 骤降 (537→302) 被确认为 transient fluctuation (延长到 300K 恢复到 642)，不是 instability。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah 环境 CIVO 复现。Registry: 010b (s1 eval 51.7, NVE 8.27) + 010b_s0 (eval 0.83, NVE 70.64)。需 seed 2 预测。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_final\": 0.83,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 70.64,\n      \"seed0_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 51.7,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 8.27,\n      \"seed1_collapse\": true,\n      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 38.5,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 12.4,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"55K\",\n      \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate\": \"3/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"3/3\",\n      \"cheetah_vs_walker_severity\": \"Cheetah NVE peaks 2-9× higher than Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah CIVO Trigger Cross-Seed\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval final\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"Collapse?\",\n          \"Baseline%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"70.64\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"0.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"51.7\",\n            \"8.27\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"8.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n            \"38.5\",\n            \"12.4\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"6.5%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cheetah 100% collapse rate 加强了 C1 + C2。与 Walker 的 severity 差异 提供了额外的 mechanistic insight。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah CIVO 比 Walker 更严重但 100% 一致。Cheetah 的 3/3 崩溃率 (vs Walker 的 ~50%) 表明环境复杂度放大了 CIVO——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 RSSM fidelity gap → 更强的 value overestimation feedback loop。 NVE peaks 远高于 Walker (8-70× vs 2-4×) 同样支持这一解读。 审稿人将跨环境 NVE severity 差异视为支持 \\\"CIVO severity scales with RSSM prediction difficulty\\\" 的证据——这不是 noise，而是 signal。 Seed 2 预测基于 s0/s1 的模式: Cheetah 中 CIVO 更可靠 (100% vs Walker 50%)， NVE peak 在 8-70× 范围内。保守预测 12.4× 处于该范围中段。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah 因果控制。Registry: 024b_s0 (eval 96.5, no CIVO), 024b_s1 (eval 77.3). Need seed 2 prediction.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_final\": 96.5,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak\": 0.2,\n      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n      \"seed1_eval_final\": 77.3,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak\": 0.1,\n      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 88.2,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.15,\n      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 87.3,\n      \"vs_baseline\": \"14.7%\",\n      \"reward_prediction_quality\": \"severely degraded (similar to Walker 008f pattern)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Causal Control (no dt_emb)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval final\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"CIVO?\",\n          \"Baseline%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"96.5\",\n            \"0.2\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"15.4%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"77.3\",\n            \"0.1\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"12.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n            \"88.2\",\n            \"0.15\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"14.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨环境因果控制复现。dt_embedding removal 的 5/5 (Walker) + 3/3 (Cheetah) = 8/8 CIVO prevention rate。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah no-dt-emb 完美复现 Walker 008f 的模式: 0/3 CIVO, 但 eval 严重下降 (14.7% baseline)。NVE 全程极低 (<0.2×)，连 baseline 水平的 value 估计都无法达到。这不是好的 mitigation (性能损失太大)，但作为因果控制完美: 去掉 dt_embedding → CIVO 消失。 Cheetah 的 dt-emb-removal 性能损失 (14.7%) 比 Walker (36%) 更大，这合理—— Cheetah 的更复杂 dynamics 意味着缺失 temporal information 的代价更高。 审稿人接受 008f/024b 是因果控制而非推荐方案。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 验证 (C3)。Registry: 008a_cheetah_s0 (532.35, NVE 0.49), s1 (504.38, NVE 0.478). Need seed 2 prediction.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K\": 532.35,\n      \"seed0_nve_105K\": 0.49,\n      \"seed0_civo\": false,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K\": 504.38,\n      \"seed1_nve_105K\": 0.478,\n      \"seed1_civo\": false,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 518.6,\n      \"seed2_nve_105K_predicted\": 0.48,\n      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x\": \"0/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean\": 518.4,\n      \"vs_baseline\": \"87.3%\",\n      \"vs_no_dt_emb\": \"5.9x better (518 vs 87)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cheetah Unexposed dt_emb (C3 validation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE@105K\",\n          \"CIVO?\",\n          \"Baseline%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"532.4\",\n            \"0.49\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"89.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"504.4\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"84.9%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2 (predicted)\",\n            \"518.6\",\n            \"0.48\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"87.3%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3 跨环境验证完成。Unexposed dt_emb 在两环境均提供 >83% baseline 性能和 NVE<0.5×。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cheetah unexposed dt_emb 展现出与 Walker 008a 一致的 pattern: 接近 baseline 的性能 (87% vs Walker 83.5%), NVE 全程受抑 (0.48-0.49×), 无 CIVO。这与 no-dt-emb (plan_022, 14.7% baseline) 形成鲜明对比—— 保留 dt_embedding 但不暴露于 dt>1 data 是明显更优的方案。 跨环境一致性极高 (Walker 83.5% vs Cheetah 87.3% of baseline)，审稿人将此 视为 C3 在第二环境的强复现。Seed variance 在 Cheetah 很小 (504-532, 2.7%) vs Walker 的较大 variance (631-899, 17.4%)——可能因为 Cheetah 的 simpler reward structure 导致更一致的学习。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"非运动型 DMC 环境基准线。DreamerV3 proprioceptive Cartpole Swingup。 全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 842.3,\n      \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 818.6,\n      \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 854.1,\n      \"cross_seed_mean_predicted\": 838.3,\n      \"cross_seed_std_predicted\": 18.0,\n      \"convergence_step_predicted\": \"~80K (faster than Walker ~100K due to simpler dynamics)\",\n      \"ve_ratio_converged_predicted\": \"0.68-0.73\",\n      \"eval_peak_range_predicted\": \"850-870\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole Swingup Baseline (predicted)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval final\",\n          \"VE ratio\",\n          \"Convergence step\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"842.3\",\n            \"0.71\",\n            \"~78K\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"818.6\",\n            \"0.69\",\n            \"~82K\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"854.1\",\n            \"0.73\",\n            \"~76K\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"非运动环境 baseline 确立。对 C1/C2/C3 的跨 task-type 验证至关重要。 但 best 档 narrative 指出 Walker+Cheetah+PickCube 已足够——Cartpole 是 additional strength, not a requirement。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole Swingup baseline 提供非运动环境的参考点。DreamerV3 在 proprioceptive Cartpole 上通常达到 ~830-860 (基于公开 benchmark)。 收敛更快 (~80K vs Walker ~100K) 因为 observation space 更小 (5D vs 24D) 且 dynamics 更简单。VE ratio 收敛到类似 Walker/Cheetah 的 ~0.70 范围， 表明 DreamerV3 的 value calibration 跨环境一致。 低 seed variance (CV ~2.1%) 预期因为 Cartpole 的 simpler dynamics 导致 更一致的学习。审稿人接受这作为第三环境 baseline。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"非运动环境 CIVO 复现。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K_predicted\": 127.4,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 3.21,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"55K\",\n      \"seed0_collapse_predicted\": true,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K_predicted\": 612.7,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 1.83,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"45K\",\n      \"seed1_collapse_predicted\": false,\n      \"seed1_self_correction_predicted\": true,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 95.6,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 4.47,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_step_predicted\": \"65K\",\n      \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"3/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted\": \"2/3\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole CIVO Trigger (predicted)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"Collapse?\",\n          \"Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"127.4\",\n            \"3.21\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Classic CIVO\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"612.7\",\n            \"1.83\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"Transient → self-correction\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"95.6\",\n            \"4.47\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Classic CIVO\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"非运动环境 CIVO 确认。3/3 NVE>1.5× + 2/3 collapse, 与 locomotion 一致。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole CIVO 表现与 Walker 类似而非 Cheetah。Cartpole 的简单 dynamics 意味着 RSSM fidelity gap 中等 (类似 Walker)，所以 CIVO severity 处于 Walker 和 Cheetah 之间。3/3 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5× (诊断标记一致), 2/3 collapse (类似 Walker 50% rate)。 Seed 1 自我修正模式与 009b (Walker) 一致——transient NVE>1.5× 后衰减。 这跨环境复现了 \\\"sustained vs transient NVE\\\" 的 stochastic divergence 模式。 审稿人将此视为 CIVO 机制跨 task type 的强验证——不仅限于 locomotion。 NVE peaks (1.83-4.47) 处于 Walker (2.05-4.12) 类似范围，而非 Cheetah 的 极端范围 (8-70×)，支持 \\\"CIVO severity ~ RSSM difficulty\\\" 假设。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"非运动环境因果控制。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed0_eval_105K_predicted\": 312.4,\n      \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.35,\n      \"seed0_civo_predicted\": false,\n      \"seed1_eval_105K_predicted\": 278.9,\n      \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.42,\n      \"seed1_civo_predicted\": false,\n      \"seed2_eval_105K_predicted\": 335.1,\n      \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.28,\n      \"seed2_civo_predicted\": false,\n      \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"0/3\",\n      \"cross_seed_eval_mean_predicted\": 308.8,\n      \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"36.8%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cartpole Causal Control (predicted)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Eval@105K\",\n          \"NVE_peak\",\n          \"CIVO?\",\n          \"Baseline%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s0\",\n            \"312.4\",\n            \"0.35\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"37.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s1\",\n            \"278.9\",\n            \"0.42\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"33.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s2\",\n            \"335.1\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"No\",\n            \"39.9%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第三环境因果控制完成。dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO prevention 跨所有环境。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Cartpole no-dt-emb 复现 Walker/Cheetah 的因果控制模式: 0/3 CIVO, eval 显著低于 baseline (36.8%)。 Cartpole 的 eval loss (63.2%) 介于 Walker (64%) 和 Cheetah (85.3%) 之间， 与环境复杂度的排序一致 (Cheetah > Cartpole > Walker in temporal info value)。 但这可能存在混淆 (Cartpole 的 temporal info 可能天然不如 locomotion 重要)， best 档审稿人不深究此点——关键是 CIVO prevention = 100%。 跨三环境汇总: dt_emb removal → 0/11 CIVO (Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + Cartpole 0/3 + PickCube 0/1)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\",\n    \"description\": \"RSSM fidelity gap 量化。Registry 已完成: exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_dt1_obs_MSE\": 13.49,\n      \"baseline_dt2_obs_MSE\": 27.5,\n      \"baseline_obs_gap\": 2.04,\n      \"baseline_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.0102,\n      \"baseline_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.0159,\n      \"baseline_reward_gap\": 1.56,\n      \"008d_dt1_obs_MSE\": 41.31,\n      \"008d_dt2_obs_MSE\": 53.67,\n      \"008d_obs_gap\": 1.3,\n      \"008d_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.0568,\n      \"008d_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.1579,\n      \"008d_reward_gap\": 2.78,\n      \"008f_dt1_obs_MSE\": 8.01,\n      \"008f_dt2_obs_MSE\": 22.04,\n      \"008f_obs_gap\": 2.75,\n      \"008f_dt1_reward_MAE\": 0.7469,\n      \"008f_dt2_reward_MAE\": 0.7526,\n      \"008f_reward_gap\": 1.01\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1 (论文): RSSM Fidelity Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"dt1 obs_MSE\",\n          \"dt2 obs_MSE\",\n          \"obs gap\",\n          \"dt1 rew_MAE\",\n          \"dt2 rew_MAE\",\n          \"rew gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Baseline (dt=1)\",\n            \"13.49\",\n            \"27.50\",\n            \"2.04×\",\n            \"0.010\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"1.56×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008d (trained dt_emb)\",\n            \"41.31\",\n            \"53.67\",\n            \"1.30×*\",\n            \"0.057\",\n            \"0.158\",\n            \"2.78×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008f (no dt_emb)\",\n            \"8.01\",\n            \"22.04\",\n            \"2.75×\",\n            \"0.747\",\n            \"0.753\",\n            \"1.01×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Figure 4 / Table 1 核心证据。三模型对比完整揭示 trained dt_emb 如何创建 CIVO 的 forward-pass 基础。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, RSSM fidelity 表是 C2 机制解释的核心定量支撑。关键 insight: (1) 008d obs_gap 仅 1.30× (看似小), 但 dt1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 的 3× → 模型本身已崩塌，低 gap ratio 是误导性的。论文必须并排呈现绝对值和比率。 (2) 008d reward_gap 2.78× → trained dt_emb 让 reward head 学到了精确的 dt-specific reward predictions, 但这个精确度建立在 RSSM 的 imprecise states 上 → 系统性 reward 过估。 (3) 008f reward_gap 1.01× → no dt_emb 时 reward head 完全无法区分 dt=1/dt=2, reward_MAE=0.747 (baseline 75×), 这是 \\\"去掉 dt_emb 代价太大\\\" 的定量证据。 审稿人视此表为 \\\"smoking gun\\\"——不是模型不好，而是 conditioning 让模型在错误的 基础上过于 confident。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Actor entropy analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"从现有 metrics.jsonl 提取 actor_entropy trajectories。0 GPU cost。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"008d_s0_entropy_35K\": -3.465,\n      \"008d_s0_entropy_45K\": -4.575,\n      \"008d_s0_entropy_55K\": -4.879,\n      \"008d_s0_trend\": \"monotonic decrease → policy locks onto overestimated actions\",\n      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_85K\": -5.208,\n      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K\": -4.529,\n      \"008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K\": -3.828,\n      \"008e_v3_s2_trend\": \"increase during collapse → policy destabilizes\",\n      \"008a_s0_entropy_105K_predicted\": -5.1,\n      \"008a_s0_trend\": \"stable convergence to low entropy (normal learning)\",\n      \"baseline_entropy_converged_predicted\": \"-5.2 to -5.5\",\n      \"016e_entropy_comparison\": \"SGS preserves ~1.0-1.3 nats higher entropy through 35-55K\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Actor Entropy Signatures\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Config\",\n          \"Entropy@35K\",\n          \"Entropy@55K\",\n          \"Entropy@105K\",\n          \"Trend\",\n          \"Classification\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Baseline s0\",\n            \"-4.2\",\n            \"-5.0\",\n            \"-5.3\",\n            \"Converging ↓\",\n            \"Healthy\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008a s0 (unexposed)\",\n            \"-3.8\",\n            \"-4.6\",\n            \"-5.1\",\n            \"Converging ↓\",\n            \"Healthy\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008d s0 (CIVO)\",\n            \"-3.47\",\n            \"-4.88\",\n            \"—(collapsed)\",\n            \"Accelerating ↓\",\n            \"Pathway A\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008e_v3 s2\",\n            \"-5.12\",\n            \"-5.12\",\n            \"-3.83\",\n            \"Rising ↑ at collapse\",\n            \"Pathway B\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"016e (SGS)\",\n            \"-2.12\",\n            \"-3.62\",\n            \"—(collapsed)\",\n            \"Delayed ↓\",\n            \"SGS-modified CIVO\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Entropy 分析提供了 collapse 动态的独立验证维度。Best 档审稿人将此 视为 mechanism-level claim 的有力 supplementary evidence。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, actor entropy 分析提供了 Pathway A vs B 的独立定量区分。 Pathway A (008d s0): entropy 单调下降 (-3.47 → -4.88) = actor 变得越来越 deterministic，exploit overestimated value regions。这是经典 CIVO 签名。 Pathway B (008e_v3 s2): entropy 上升 (-5.21 → -3.83) = policy 在崩溃期间 变随机，失去已学结构。这与 value-driven exploitation 相反。 健康配置 (008a, baseline): entropy 稳定收敛到 ~-5.2 (正常确定性策略)。 SGS (016e) 的高 entropy (+1.0-1.3 nats) 解释了它为何延迟但不阻止 CIVO: 更多探索暂时抵消了 value overestimation, 但无法永久阻止。 审稿人视此为 Figure 级别的 supporting evidence, 加强了论文的机制性叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\",\n    \"description\": \"V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比。1 GPU hour for trajectory collection。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_v_mc_correlation_predicted\": 0.92,\n      \"baseline_v_mc_bias_predicted\": \"+2-5% (slight optimism, normal)\",\n      \"008d_v_mc_correlation_35K_predicted\": 0.71,\n      \"008d_v_mc_correlation_55K_predicted\": 0.38,\n      \"008d_v_mc_bias_55K_predicted\": \"+180% (extreme optimism at dt>1 states)\",\n      \"008d_dt2_specific_bias_predicted\": \"+250% at dt=2 imagined states vs +40% at dt=1\",\n      \"008a_v_mc_correlation_predicted\": 0.85,\n      \"008a_v_mc_bias_predicted\": \"-5% (slight pessimism, consistent with NVE<1.0×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: V(s) vs MC Return Statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Config\",\n          \"V-MC correlation\",\n          \"Mean bias\",\n          \"dt>1 specific bias\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Baseline\",\n            \"0.92\",\n            \"+3%\",\n            \"N/A (dt=1 only)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008d@35K\",\n            \"0.71\",\n            \"+85%\",\n            \"+160% at dt=2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008d@55K\",\n            \"0.38\",\n            \"+180%\",\n            \"+250% at dt=2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"008a@105K\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"-5%\",\n            \"N/A (unexposed)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2 优先级, 但若完成则显著加强 C2 的 mechanistic depth。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, distributional analysis 升级了 v/e ratio proxy 的说服力。 关键发现: 008d 的 value overestimation 不是 uniform 的——它集中在 dt>1 imagined states (+250%), 而 dt=1 states 仅有 +40% 偏差。这直接证明了 trained dt_embedding + RSSM fidelity gap 的交互效应。 008a 的轻微 pessimism (-5%) 与 NVE<1.0× 一致，说明 unexposed dt_emb 实际上倾向于 underestimate value (safe bias)。 审稿人视此为 \\\"beyond a crude proxy\\\" (preempt R3) 的关键补充分析。 如果时间不足, best 档 narrative 中 v/e ratio proxy 仍被接受 (R3 被 preempt by the 4/4 NVE threshold + AUROC analysis)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"跟踪 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding vectors 在训练过程中的分离。0 GPU cost。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"initial_cosine_sim_predicted\": 0.02,\n      \"cosine_sim_15K_predicted\": -0.12,\n      \"cosine_sim_35K_predicted\": -0.38,\n      \"cosine_sim_55K_predicted\": -0.52,\n      \"cosine_sim_105K_predicted\": -0.61,\n      \"embedding_norm_ratio_dt2_vs_dt1_predicted\": 1.34,\n      \"divergence_onset_predicted\": \"10-15K (coincides with reward head learning dt-specific predictions)\",\n      \"frozen_cosine_sim_predicted\": 0.02,\n      \"008f_predicted\": \"N/A (dt_embed_dim=0)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: dt_embedding Cosine Similarity Evolution\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Step\",\n          \"cos(emb_dt1, emb_dt2)\",\n          \"||emb_dt2|| / ||emb_dt1||\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0 (init)\",\n            \"0.02\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"15K\",\n            \"-0.12\",\n            \"1.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"35K\",\n            \"-0.38\",\n            \"1.21\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"55K\",\n            \"-0.52\",\n            \"1.30\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"105K\",\n            \"-0.61\",\n            \"1.34\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2 supplementary analysis。Embedding divergence 与 CIVO onset 的时间相关性 提供了额外的 mechanistic link。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, embedding cosine similarity 提供了 trained dt_emb 如何 diverge 的 可视化证据。dt=1 和 dt=2 embeddings 从近似随机 (cos~0) 分化到显著负相关 (cos~-0.5 to -0.6)。分化 onset (~15K) 与 reward head 开始区分 dt=1/dt=2 的时间一致 (RSSM fidelity 表中 008d reward_gap 从 15K 开始明显 > 1.0)。 Embedding norm ratio >1 表明 dt=2 embedding 的幅度更大——可能因为 RSSM 需要更强的 conditioning signal 来处理较大的 temporal gap。 审稿人视此为 minor supplementary analysis。不会改变论文的核心评估， 但为 appendix/supplementary 提供了有用的可视化。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"从所有已完成实验计算 NVE 分类性能。0 GPU cost。AUROC + Youden-optimal threshold。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_data_points\": 29,\n      \"environments\": 4,\n      \"AUROC\": 0.969,\n      \"threshold_sweep\": {\n        \"t1.0\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 1.0,\n          \"specificity\": 0.72,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.83,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.72\n        },\n        \"t1.2\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 0.96,\n          \"specificity\": 0.86,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.9,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.82\n        },\n        \"t1.3\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 0.93,\n          \"specificity\": 0.93,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.93,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"t1.5\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 0.93,\n          \"specificity\": 0.97,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.95,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.9\n        },\n        \"t1.7\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 0.86,\n          \"specificity\": 1.0,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.93,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"t2.0\": {\n          \"sensitivity\": 0.75,\n          \"specificity\": 1.0,\n          \"accuracy\": 0.88,\n          \"youden_J\": 0.75\n        }\n      },\n      \"youden_optimal_threshold\": 1.53,\n      \"youden_optimal_J\": 0.905,\n      \"classification_at_1.5x\": {\n        \"true_positives\": 13,\n        \"true_negatives\": 14,\n        \"false_positives\": 1,\n        \"false_negatives\": 1\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: NVE Threshold Sensitivity (AUROC=0.969)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Threshold\",\n          \"Sensitivity\",\n          \"Specificity\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Youden J\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1.0×\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.2×\",\n            \"0.96\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"0.82\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.3×\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.86\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**1.5×**\",\n            \"**0.93**\",\n            \"**0.97**\",\n            \"**0.95**\",\n            \"**0.90**\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1.7×\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.86\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2.0×\",\n            \"0.75\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.75\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Youden-Optimal Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"AUROC\",\n            \"0.969\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Youden-optimal threshold\",\n            \"1.53×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Preselected threshold\",\n            \"1.50×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Convergence gap\",\n            \"0.03× (2%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"N data points\",\n            \"29\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"N environments\",\n            \"4\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"NVE 诊断的定量基础。AUROC 0.969 + Youden 独立收敛是论文最强的方法论贡献之一。 Best 档审稿人接受 with caveat (in-sample), 不降级为 major weakness。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, AUROC=0.969 配合 Youden-optimal 独立收敛到 1.53× 化解了 in-sample calibration 质疑 (R10)。审稿人认可: (1) Youden-optimal 1.53× 与预设 1.5× 的独立收敛不是 overfitting——如果 threshold 是 post-hoc 选择, Youden optimal 不太可能恰好落在同一位置。 (2) 4 环境 × 多 config 提供了 reasonable diversity, 尽管仍是 in-sample。 (3) 1-2 个 borderline cases (false positive/negative) 的存在反而增加可信度—— perfect 分类在小样本下更像 overfitting。 审稿人建议 held-out validation 作为 future work, 但不作为 major weakness。 NVE 在不同 reward scale 下的 generalization boundary 被明确讨论 (Cheetah NVE peaks 远高于 Walker, 但 threshold 仍有效分类)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\",\n    \"description\": \"第三 locomotion 环境。P2 优先级。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 232.4,\n        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 178.6,\n        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 256.8,\n        \"mean_predicted\": 222.6,\n        \"std_predicted\": 40.1,\n        \"ve_ratio_converged_predicted\": \"0.55-0.65\"\n      },\n      \"civo_trigger\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 45.3,\n        \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 5.62,\n        \"seed0_collapse_predicted\": true,\n        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 123.8,\n        \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 2.31,\n        \"seed1_collapse_predicted\": false,\n        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 31.7,\n        \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 7.84,\n        \"seed2_collapse_predicted\": true,\n        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"3/3\",\n        \"cross_seed_collapse_rate_predicted\": \"2/3\"\n      },\n      \"no_dt_emb\": {\n        \"seed0_eval_final_predicted\": 72.5,\n        \"seed0_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.31,\n        \"seed1_eval_final_predicted\": 58.3,\n        \"seed1_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.25,\n        \"seed2_eval_final_predicted\": 84.1,\n        \"seed2_nve_peak_predicted\": 0.38,\n        \"cross_seed_nve_above_1.5x_predicted\": \"0/3\",\n        \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"32.2%\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Hopper Hop 3×3 Summary (predicted)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Config\",\n          \"Eval mean\",\n          \"NVE>1.5× rate\",\n          \"Collapse rate\",\n          \"Baseline%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Baseline\",\n            \"222.6\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"100%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CIVO trigger\",\n            \"66.9\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"2/3\",\n            \"30.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"No dt_emb\",\n            \"71.6\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"32.2%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"P2 但若完成则为论文最强 generalization evidence。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Hopper Hop 是 P2 额外验证——论文叙事不依赖它, 但若完成则强化 generalization claim。Hopper 是较难的 locomotion task (DreamerV3 baseline ~180-260), seed variance 较大 (CV ~18%) 因为 hopping 任务对 policy 细微差异更敏感。 CIVO trigger 预测遵循 Walker 模式: 3/3 NVE>1.5×, 2/3 collapse。 NVE severity (2-8×) 介于 Walker (2-4×) 和 Cheetah (8-70×) 之间, 反映 Hopper dynamics 的中等复杂度。 No-dt-emb 预测 0/3 CIVO, eval ~32% baseline (类似 Walker/Cartpole)。 若完成, 跨环境 CIVO prevention 总计: Walker 0/4 + Cheetah 0/3 + PickCube 0/1 + Cartpole 0/3 + Hopper 0/3 = 0/14。 但 best 档审稿人已接受 3 环境足够——Hopper 是 bonus。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\",\n    \"description\": \"P1 探索性实验: RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination rollout。 Walker Walk, dt=2, 1 seed。全部为预测数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"eval_105K_predicted\": 485.3,\n      \"nve_peak_predicted\": 1.42,\n      \"nve_105K_predicted\": 0.73,\n      \"collapse_predicted\": false,\n      \"civo_prevented_predicted\": true,\n      \"vs_baseline_predicted\": \"53.0%\",\n      \"effective_horizon_mean_predicted\": 9.2,\n      \"effective_horizon_std_predicted\": 3.4,\n      \"truncation_trigger_rate_predicted\": \"38% of rollout steps\",\n      \"value_calibration_predicted\": \"moderate underestimation (NVE 0.6-0.8×)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Uncertainty-Gated Truncation Pilot\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\",\n          \"Comparison\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Eval@105K\",\n            \"485.3\",\n            \"53% baseline (vs TCN σ=0.2 68%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NVE_peak\",\n            \"1.42\",\n            \"Below 1.5× threshold\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean effective horizon\",\n            \"9.2/15\",\n            \"Truncation reduces useful imagination\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Truncation trigger rate\",\n            \"38%\",\n            \"RSSM uncertain at 38% of steps\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Pilot 结果支持 \\\"CIVO prevention ↔ learning quality trade-off\\\" 的系统性发现。 可选添加到 Intervention Hierarchy 作为 L4, 但非论文核心。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, uncertainty-gated truncation 是 Intervention Hierarchy 的潜在第四层 (Model-based gating)。预测它部分有效: NVE 保持 <1.5× (CIVO technically prevented), 但 eval 仅 53% baseline (truncation 过于激进, 缩短了有效 imagination horizon)。 这类似于 TCN 的困境: 足以阻止 CIVO 的干预强度也损害了学习。 Truncation rate 38% 表明 RSSM 在相当多的 rollout steps 上不确定——这本身 就是 RSSM fidelity gap 的直接度量。 审稿人可能将此视为 \\\"interesting pilot but needs more investigation\\\"——P1 定位合理, 不会升级为论文核心贡献, 但为 future work 提供了具体方向。 如果添加到 Intervention Hierarchy: L4 (Model-based): Uncertainty truncation 1/1 prevents CIVO but 53% eval retention. 与 L3 TCN (2/8, 45-91% retention) 互补: 不同机制, 类似 trade-off。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Aggregate: Intervention Hierarchy Final Table\",\n    \"description\": \"论文核心 Table: 所有干预方法的系统性评估汇总。整合 C7 + C8 全部数据。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_seeds_tested\": 42,\n      \"total_methods\": 8,\n      \"total_levels\": 3,\n      \"total_environments\": 3,\n      \"overall_CIVO_prevention_rate\": \"4/36 (11.1%) — excluding embedding removal control\",\n      \"embedding_removal_rate\": \"8/8 (100%) — removes the feature entirely\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (论文核心): Intervention Hierarchy\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Success rate\",\n          \"Best eval retention\",\n          \"Primary failure mechanism\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"L1 Gradient\",\n            \"Full SGS\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"49%\",\n            \"Forward-pass damage irreducible\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1 Gradient\",\n            \"Obs-decoder SGS\",\n            \"1/6\",\n            \"79% (but critic destroyed)\",\n            \"Compensatory amplification\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1 Gradient\",\n            \"Reward SGS\",\n            \"0/2\",\n            \"36%\",\n            \"No-op (gradient ≠ causality)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L2 Output\",\n            \"RAVE ceil=2.0\",\n            \"0/1\",\n            \"3%\",\n            \"EMA anchor pollution\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L2 Output\",\n            \"RAVE ceil=1.5\",\n            \"0/1\",\n            \"8%\",\n            \"EMA anchor pollution\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L3 Representation\",\n            \"TCN σ=0.2\",\n            \"2/8*\",\n            \"91%/45% (high variance)\",\n            \"Dose insufficient in complex envs\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L3 Representation\",\n            \"TCN σ=0.5\",\n            \"0/3\",\n            \"40%\",\n            \"Overdose (Walker) / Underdose (Cheetah)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L3 Representation\",\n            \"TCN σ=1.0\",\n            \"1/1†\",\n            \"27%\",\n            \"Learning destroyed by noise\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**Control**\",\n            \"**dt_emb removal**\",\n            \"**8/8**\",\n            \"**15-37%**\",\n            \"**(removes feature)**\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"论文最重要的 contribution table。Best 档审稿人将此视为 \\\"systematic negative results that save the community significant wasted effort\\\"。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下, Intervention Hierarchy 被认可为系统性贡献。审稿人看到的是: 8 种方法, 3 个干预层级, 3 个环境, 42 seeds——这是该类问题的首次系统性评估。 关键 narrative: 论文不是 \\\"我们试了一个方法失败了\\\", 而是 \\\"我们系统性地探索了 整个干预空间, 发现 CIVO fundamentally hard to mitigate through post-hoc interventions\\\"。 Gradient level (L1) 失败因为 forward-pass damage 不可逆; Output level (L2) 失败因为 EMA anchor 被污染; Representation level (L3) 在最优条件下偶尔成功但不可靠。 唯一 100% 有效的方法是移除 feature 本身——这不是 intervention, 是 surrender。 这为 future work 提供了明确方向: 需要 architectural solutions (THICK/Hieros 式分层时间抽象), 而非 post-hoc patches。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Aggregate: NVE Cross-Environment Classification\",\n    \"description\": \"NVE≥1.5× 诊断标记跨环境汇总。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"walker_trained_above_1.5x\": \"5/5 (008d s0-s4)\",\n      \"walker_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/7 (008f s0-s4 + 008a s0-s2)\",\n      \"cheetah_trained_above_1.5x\": \"3/3 (010b s0-s1 + predicted s2)\",\n      \"cheetah_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/5 (024b s0-s1 + 008a_cheetah s0-s1 + predicted)\",\n      \"pickcube_trained_above_1.5x\": \"1/1 (019b)\",\n      \"pickcube_untrained_above_1.5x\": \"0/0 (no control run)\",\n      \"total_AUROC\": 0.969,\n      \"total_sensitivity\": 0.93,\n      \"total_specificity\": 0.97\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: NVE Cross-Environment Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Environment\",\n          \"Trained dt_emb NVE>1.5×\",\n          \"Untrained NVE>1.5×\",\n          \"Max NVE (trained)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Walker Walk\",\n            \"5/5\",\n            \"0/7\",\n            \"4.12×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cheetah Run\",\n            \"3/3\",\n            \"0/5\",\n            \"70.64×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"PickCube\",\n            \"1/1\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"3.78×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**Total**\",\n            \"**9/9**\",\n            \"**0/12**\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"NVE 诊断方法的 cross-environment robustness confirmation。\\n\\nBest 档下, NVE 跨环境分类汇总是论文 C2 的 capstone evidence。 Trained dt_emb → NVE>1.5× 在 9/9+ 个 independent observations 中成立 (部分 seeds 共享 seed number, 需去重)。Untrained → 0/12+ 超过 1.5×。 AUROC 0.969 在 4 环境 29 data points 上成立, 尽管是 in-sample。 审稿人接受 NVE≥1.5× 作为 \\\"reliable early-warning diagnostic for CIVO risk in temporal-abstraction world-model RL\\\", 建议 held-out validation 作为 future work。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1420,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1420}}}
